(2100478, 287994, 15511, '<td valign="top">Advertising... this would be great. <br/>Soichiro would approve!</td>', 'Advertising... this would be great. Soichiro would approve!', '2006-01-30 01:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100481, 285075, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m a radiator repair man too!  Uhh...repair PERSON actually, I build them, and if they get dented up when we are making them, we fix them.  Anyway... I like him.  He''s got a lot of character and the photo has personality.  I don''t mind the darkness on the right because there is a catchlight in his eye that makes up for it.  I wish his eyes were crisper, but the overall photo has nice focus.  The background works, and color is nice as well.  Very lovely photo.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m a radiator repair man too!  Uhh...repair PERSON actually, I build them, and if they get dented up when we are making them, we fix them.  Anyway... I like him.  He''s got a lot of character and the photo has personality.  I don''t mind the darkness on the right because there is a catchlight in his eye that makes up for it.  I wish his eyes were crisper, but the overall photo has nice focus.  The background works, and color is nice as well.  Very lovely photo.  ~Heather~', '2006-01-30 01:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100482, 287763, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a spectacular photo.  Certainly my favorite so far!  10</td>', 'What a spectacular photo.  Certainly my favorite so far!  10', '2006-01-30 01:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100483, 287029, 42984, '<td valign="top">Pitty you couldn''t get it sharp. Did you sharpen after resizing? That''s the one you _must_ do. The right ee might be sharp but the light is drawing the viewer to his left eye and that''s why you''ll be getting similar comments.</td>', 'Pitty you couldn''t get it sharp. Did you sharpen after resizing? That''s the one you _must_ do. The right ee might be sharp but the light is drawing the viewer to his left eye and that''s why you''ll be getting similar comments.', '2006-01-30 01:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100484, 287515, 43434, '<td valign="top">Wow .. my name is immortilised in a street name .. great shot!</td>', 'Wow .. my name is immortilised in a street name .. great shot!', '2006-01-30 01:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
