(2100498, 287515, 42984, '<td valign="top">Love this kind of imagery. Well balanced lighting of the highlights (not blown) and the shadows (not black). As we say in the trade, good halftones</td>', 'Love this kind of imagery. Well balanced lighting of the highlights (not blown) and the shadows (not black). As we say in the trade, good halftones', '2006-01-30 01:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
