(2100867, 287985, 10867, '<td valign="top">I may be missing something, but this image looks centred rather than off-centred to me.  Beautifully sharp, clear picture, though.</td>', 'I may be missing something, but this image looks centred rather than off-centred to me.  Beautifully sharp, clear picture, though.', '2006-01-30 03:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100868, 286419, 42984, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but just sick of pets in DPC challenges even though this is really well composed, lit and focussed.  I know that sounds unfair but it''s just too easy to not move from the living room and shoot the pet.  Also the pet ''genre'' here is generally of a very low quality. It''s a good club to stay away from.</td>', 'Sorry, but just sick of pets in DPC challenges even though this is really well composed, lit and focussed.  I know that sounds unfair but it''s just too easy to not move from the living room and shoot the pet.  Also the pet ''genre'' here is generally of a very low quality. It''s a good club to stay away from.', '2006-01-30 03:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2100871, 286762, 42984, '<td valign="top">It looks oversharpened on the sand bar. I still rather like this, nice and gutsy.</td>', 'It looks oversharpened on the sand bar. I still rather like this, nice and gutsy.', '2006-01-30 03:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
