(2100880, 287185, 25355, '<td valign="top">Ok, for a dog he''s cute (I''m not a dog person). The depth of field is amazlng. The toy is distracting (or is that the subject of the photo?) but I think the head is too central.</td>', 'Ok, for a dog he''s cute (I''m not a dog person). The depth of field is amazlng. The toy is distracting (or is that the subject of the photo?) but I think the head is too central.', '2006-01-30 03:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
