(2101264, 287873, 15711, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  A classic with the single tree on the blue snowy scene.  No complaints here. 10</td>', 'Stunning.  A classic with the single tree on the blue snowy scene.  No complaints here. 10', '2006-01-30 08:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101265, 287150, 15711, '<td valign="top">OH MY GAWD!!!! The best of the challenge. I wish I could give it a 15. The black and white with that touch of RED - WOW.  EXCELLENT 10 10 10 10  Oh, and adding to favorites as well.  (hee hee - I think I know who took this)</td>', 'OH MY GAWD!!!! The best of the challenge. I wish I could give it a 15. The black and white with that touch of RED - WOW.  EXCELLENT 10 10 10 10  Oh, and adding to favorites as well.  (hee hee - I think I know who took this)', '2006-01-30 08:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101268, 287233, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just love this. You don''t usually see a solid white building like this. The texture of the bricks is great. Almost surreal like it''s floating.  The window''s green in combination with the deep blue sky and the trees'' reflection are really eye catching.  WOW 10</td>', 'I just love this. You don''t usually see a solid white building like this. The texture of the bricks is great. Almost surreal like it''s floating.  The window''s green in combination with the deep blue sky and the trees'' reflection are really eye catching.  WOW 10', '2006-01-30 08:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101270, 287952, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Nice lighting and the focus on him is good. It has a touch of softness which goes along with a young child.  Good job. 9</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Nice lighting and the focus on him is good. It has a touch of softness which goes along with a young child.  Good job. 9', '2006-01-30 08:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101273, 287185, 15711, '<td valign="top">SO CUTE! Love the studio sense of it which you don''t usually see with an animal. I really like the lighting.  What is that thing by his feet? I''m still trying to figure it out. It''s almost a distraction to me, but otherwise a perfect image.  His face and eyes - AWESOME 9</td>', 'SO CUTE! Love the studio sense of it which you don''t usually see with an animal. I really like the lighting.  What is that thing by his feet? I''m still trying to figure it out. It''s almost a distraction to me, but otherwise a perfect image.  His face and eyes - AWESOME 9', '2006-01-30 08:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101274, 287564, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really good.  So simple, yet effective. Love the negative black space. 8</td>', 'Really good.  So simple, yet effective. Love the negative black space. 8', '2006-01-30 08:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101275, 287739, 32133, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  You should try cropping right above the dark part of the blinds so that they don''t go from light to dark back to light.  Also the bottom of the blind not being parallel to the table is distracting.</td>', 'Nice composition.  You should try cropping right above the dark part of the blinds so that they don''t go from light to dark back to light.  Also the bottom of the blind not being parallel to the table is distracting.', '2006-01-30 08:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101276, 287525, 9073, '<td valign="top">A reflector to weaken the facial shadow was necessary. Otherwise, I like the juxtaposition of the big god overlooking the small one.  The line created brings this photo to life.</td>', 'A reflector to weaken the facial shadow was necessary. Otherwise, I like the juxtaposition of the big god overlooking the small one.  The line created brings this photo to life.', '2006-01-30 08:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101277, 286789, 32133, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!</td>', 'What a cutie!', '2006-01-30 08:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101278, 287754, 25331, '<td valign="top">great title unfortunately</td>', 'great title unfortunately', '2006-01-30 08:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101279, 287907, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really good. I like the de-saturated skin.  It looks like porcelain.  Beautiful clarity on the eyes and mouth.  The mole is a perfect piece de resistance!  Excellent. 9</td>', 'Really good. I like the de-saturated skin.  It looks like porcelain.  Beautiful clarity on the eyes and mouth.  The mole is a perfect piece de resistance!  Excellent. 9', '2006-01-30 08:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101281, 287515, 15711, '<td valign="top">I am bumping up.  This is wonderful.  I love theleading line and layers of texture.  Great post editing.  9</td>', 'I am bumping up.  This is wonderful.  I love theleading line and layers of texture.  Great post editing.  9', '2006-01-30 08:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101283, 286036, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is so captivating.  I studied it for a long time.  His eyes and the layers of feathers, not to mention the variation of the salmon color.  His eye is stunning.  9</td>', 'This is so captivating.  I studied it for a long time.  His eyes and the layers of feathers, not to mention the variation of the salmon color.  His eye is stunning.  9', '2006-01-30 08:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101285, 287030, 9073, '<td valign="top">Choosing not to title this coupled with the faceless woman really adds to the intrigue.</td>', 'Choosing not to title this coupled with the faceless woman really adds to the intrigue.', '2006-01-30 08:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101286, 287963, 32133, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far. 10</td>', 'My favorite so far. 10', '2006-01-30 08:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101287, 287580, 32133, '<td valign="top">great lighting</td>', 'great lighting', '2006-01-30 08:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101288, 287126, 15711, '<td valign="top">So lovely. The simplicity of it makes it even more alluring to me.  The purple in combination with the green - wow.  Love the curl of the leaf along with the perfect light hitting it here and there.  It has an almost "musical note" look to it.  Very well executed shot.</td>', 'So lovely. The simplicity of it makes it even more alluring to me.  The purple in combination with the green - wow.  Love the curl of the leaf along with the perfect light hitting it here and there.  It has an almost "musical note" look to it.  Very well executed shot.', '2006-01-30 08:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101291, 287739, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice yet simple.  I like the horizontal lines of the blinds.  Nice in black and white. It gives it a starkness. 8</td>', 'Nice yet simple.  I like the horizontal lines of the blinds.  Nice in black and white. It gives it a starkness. 8', '2006-01-30 08:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101292, 287187, 25331, '<td valign="top">I believe you photo would give more impact if the duck was placed on the right side, with some negative space around him. good luck</td>', 'I believe you photo would give more impact if the duck was placed on the right side, with some negative space around him. good luck', '2006-01-30 08:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101293, 286177, 32133, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I wonder if you could have made the shadow thinner to mirror the model more.</td>', 'Great idea. I wonder if you could have made the shadow thinner to mirror the model more.', '2006-01-30 08:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101294, 287711, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this but I can''t figure out the baby. I think it detracts. I think I know what you were going for, but the 3 flowers alone would have worked better for me.  Still a really good shot and the use of negative space and light work well together to create the varying textures of the flowers.</td>', 'I really like this but I can''t figure out the baby. I think it detracts. I think I know what you were going for, but the 3 flowers alone would have worked better for me.  Still a really good shot and the use of negative space and light work well together to create the varying textures of the flowers.', '2006-01-30 08:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101296, 287909, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  The blurred companion behind helps create a story, which I like.  Good one!</td>', 'Love the title.  The blurred companion behind helps create a story, which I like.  Good one!', '2006-01-30 08:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101298, 287760, 32133, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  The door is so important to give this scale.</td>', 'Very cool shot.  The door is so important to give this scale.', '2006-01-30 08:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101299, 287848, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and not expected. Great use of negative space.  I like the soft skin mixed with the orange peel''s texture.  Great lighting too. 8</td>', 'Nicely done and not expected. Great use of negative space.  I like the soft skin mixed with the orange peel''s texture.  Great lighting too. 8', '2006-01-30 08:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
