(2101338, 285257, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really nice. I like her "off glance" and the softness of it. It''s still sharply focused.  The flowers around her head add some unexpected color. The lighting is perfect. The smoothness of the skin doesn''t seem "fake" and overdone. Not sure about the green of her top, although it ties in with the greenish tinge in her headpiece. Great eyes. 8</td>', 'Really nice. I like her "off glance" and the softness of it. It''s still sharply focused.  The flowers around her head add some unexpected color. The lighting is perfect. The smoothness of the skin doesn''t seem "fake" and overdone. Not sure about the green of her top, although it ties in with the greenish tinge in her headpiece. Great eyes. 8', '2006-01-30 08:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101340, 286875, 32133, '<td valign="top">This image is very good.  I''d love to know how you did it.</td>', 'This image is very good.  I''d love to know how you did it.', '2006-01-30 08:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101342, 287933, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good photojournalistic feel.  The character type filter really adds to it.  I love the various textures with the beat up boards, his jeans, and shirt.  If this was posed, the t-shirt was perfect with the cross and text, if not, all the better. Bumping up on 2nd review. 9</td>', 'Very nice.  Good photojournalistic feel.  The character type filter really adds to it.  I love the various textures with the beat up boards, his jeans, and shirt.  If this was posed, the t-shirt was perfect with the cross and text, if not, all the better. Bumping up on 2nd review. 9', '2006-01-30 08:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101343, 287763, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a fun image. I love her belly poking out of the stark whiteness.  Her expression is great.  Nice to see her so happy.  perfect title too. Perfect use of negative space.</td>', 'What a fun image. I love her belly poking out of the stark whiteness.  Her expression is great.  Nice to see her so happy.  perfect title too. Perfect use of negative space.', '2006-01-30 08:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
