(2101351, 287025, 9073, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sense of combat here. I don''t think, however, that the negative space adds to the photo, rather the opposite: a close-up focusing on the expressions would have been more powerful.</td>', 'Wonderful sense of combat here. I don''t think, however, that the negative space adds to the photo, rather the opposite: a close-up focusing on the expressions would have been more powerful.', '2006-01-30 08:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101352, 286796, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this but his face seems ever so slightly out of focus.  The wrinkle and color of his shirt with the white letters peeking out, kind of distracts from his face. I''d love it if he weren''t wearing a shirt at all, or perhaps a white tee shirt that blends into the background. Beautiful eyes!!!</td>', 'I like this but his face seems ever so slightly out of focus.  The wrinkle and color of his shirt with the white letters peeking out, kind of distracts from his face. I''d love it if he weren''t wearing a shirt at all, or perhaps a white tee shirt that blends into the background. Beautiful eyes!!!', '2006-01-30 08:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101357, 285431, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  I can get tired of macros of flowers, but this is so unexpected and has such an artsy feel with the curl of the petal around the stamen. Such lovey colors too.</td>', 'Lovely.  I can get tired of macros of flowers, but this is so unexpected and has such an artsy feel with the curl of the petal around the stamen. Such lovey colors too.', '2006-01-30 08:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101360, 287773, 32133, '<td valign="top">I never vote high on cat shots, but this is a really wonderful composition.  The blurred hand is a little distracting. I prefer the other hand when you can see the detail.  Nice work.  Good luck!</td>', 'I never vote high on cat shots, but this is a really wonderful composition.  The blurred hand is a little distracting. I prefer the other hand when you can see the detail.  Nice work.  Good luck!', '2006-01-30 08:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
