(2101827, 285751, 35021, '<td valign="top">SOOO CUTE!!!  I only wish the green background was a little more solid (the light line going across the bottom left is a little distracting.  I also would have softened the light source slightly.  But still a 10 in my eyes  =)  Great work!</td>', 'SOOO CUTE!!!  I only wish the green background was a little more solid (the light line going across the bottom left is a little distracting.  I also would have softened the light source slightly.  But still a 10 in my eyes  =)  Great work!', '2006-01-30 11:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101831, 287705, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is just really cool, very dynamic...the image has a really nice abstract feel to it...I like this alot.</td>', 'This is just really cool, very dynamic...the image has a really nice abstract feel to it...I like this alot.', '2006-01-30 11:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101834, 287126, 35804, '<td valign="top">...pure elegance...nicely done.</td>', '...pure elegance...nicely done.', '2006-01-30 11:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101835, 287823, 35021, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  10  =)</td>', 'Beautiful!  10  =)', '2006-01-30 11:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101837, 287765, 35804, '<td valign="top">Pretty light play...very nice.</td>', 'Pretty light play...very nice.', '2006-01-30 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101838, 287905, 44086, '<td valign="top">Good image. But, wouldn''t it be better for a full body shot to include the feet? IMHO</td>', 'Good image. But, wouldn''t it be better for a full body shot to include the feet? IMHO', '2006-01-30 11:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101840, 287952, 35021, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  Love the soft colors and soft lighting - along wih such a cute little face  =) Great job... 10</td>', 'Excellent shot!  Love the soft colors and soft lighting - along wih such a cute little face  =) Great job... 10', '2006-01-30 11:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101847, 287554, 35804, '<td valign="top">...it''s so nice to see an image on DPC that can make me feel something and stop me in my tracks...excellent candid...the title is perfect.</td>', '...it''s so nice to see an image on DPC that can make me feel something and stop me in my tracks...excellent candid...the title is perfect.', '2006-01-30 11:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101848, 287650, 35021, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sharp shot with increditble colors!  Great job!  10</td>', 'Beautiful sharp shot with increditble colors!  Great job!  10', '2006-01-30 11:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101849, 287924, 35021, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, beautiful soft lighting and colors.  Great work!!!!  =)</td>', 'Excellent composition, beautiful soft lighting and colors.  Great work!!!!  =)', '2006-01-30 11:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101855, 286276, 35804, '<td valign="top">How about those colors! So deep and rich...very nice.</td>', 'How about those colors! So deep and rich...very nice.', '2006-01-30 11:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101869, 287640, 48890, '<td valign="top">I wish for more DOF to see deeper into the flower, and a more interesting background.</td>', 'I wish for more DOF to see deeper into the flower, and a more interesting background.', '2006-01-30 12:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101871, 286406, 35804, '<td valign="top">oooooooooh...I just like this so much...makes me feel happy and hopeful...what a nice image.</td>', 'oooooooooh...I just like this so much...makes me feel happy and hopeful...what a nice image.', '2006-01-30 12:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101874, 287745, 48890, '<td valign="top">It''s off-centered, but how is it justified?  Simply filling the left part of the image with void is not the way to go IMO.</td>', 'It''s off-centered, but how is it justified?  Simply filling the left part of the image with void is not the way to go IMO.', '2006-01-30 12:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101876, 287707, 49489, '<td valign="top">i think that this is dead center.</td>', 'i think that this is dead center.', '2006-01-30 12:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101879, 287515, 35804, '<td valign="top">Excellent tones and composition...so nicely made.</td>', 'Excellent tones and composition...so nicely made.', '2006-01-30 12:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101883, 287494, 48890, '<td valign="top">I think that it''s only best because you desaturated the others...  I think that desaturation is a tool to underline something in a composition, but I don''t like when it''s the only interesting thing about a photograph.</td>', 'I think that it''s only best because you desaturated the others...  I think that desaturation is a tool to underline something in a composition, but I don''t like when it''s the only interesting thing about a photograph.', '2006-01-30 12:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101885, 287980, 48890, '<td valign="top">The void on the left is not justified compositionally.</td>', 'The void on the left is not justified compositionally.', '2006-01-30 12:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101887, 286044, 35021, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Love it!!!  The color, lighting, and composition are wonderful.  I also like the light reflections on the glass... adds texture to the photograph.  10.</td>', 'Wow!  Love it!!!  The color, lighting, and composition are wonderful.  I also like the light reflections on the glass... adds texture to the photograph.  10.', '2006-01-30 12:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101888, 286658, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I think that it would work better if the vase was in the left part of the frame.</td>', 'Nice.  I think that it would work better if the vase was in the left part of the frame.', '2006-01-30 12:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101890, 287515, 49489, '<td valign="top">beautiful job    10</td>', 'beautiful job    10', '2006-01-30 12:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101891, 287925, 48890, '<td valign="top">Not sure what''s off-centered here.  I like the shot quite a lot, otherwise, nice exposure and composition.</td>', 'Not sure what''s off-centered here.  I like the shot quite a lot, otherwise, nice exposure and composition.', '2006-01-30 12:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101893, 287039, 48890, '<td valign="top">Wishing for more DOF here.</td>', 'Wishing for more DOF here.', '2006-01-30 12:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101896, 288001, 48890, '<td valign="top">You probably mean the landscape reflected in the eye of this... animal (don''t understand who this is.  I would zoom in more and just present the eye with the reflection in the frame.   The stuff on the right hand side is distracting.</td>', 'You probably mean the landscape reflected in the eye of this... animal (don''t understand who this is.  I would zoom in more and just present the eye with the reflection in the frame.   The stuff on the right hand side is distracting.', '2006-01-30 12:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101901, 285751, 35804, '<td valign="top">Awesome! Thanks for the giggle!  : }</td>', 'Awesome! Thanks for the giggle!  : }', '2006-01-30 12:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101903, 286762, 48890, '<td valign="top">I like the top 2/3 of the shot.  The water/ice in the bottom of the frame does not add anything, I would compose to minimize it, or crop most of it out.  I would boost up the colours of the boats just a bit.</td>', 'I like the top 2/3 of the shot.  The water/ice in the bottom of the frame does not add anything, I would compose to minimize it, or crop most of it out.  I would boost up the colours of the boats just a bit.', '2006-01-30 12:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101906, 287773, 35804, '<td valign="top">Really nice candid...the bond between a cat and it''s person can be so strong...as seen in the image...well done.</td>', 'Really nice candid...the bond between a cat and it''s person can be so strong...as seen in the image...well done.', '2006-01-30 12:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101907, 287560, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject and I like the tones a lot.  I am wishing for more detail in the dark areas.  Also, I think that you''ve included way too much emptiness in the left part of the frame.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject and I like the tones a lot.  I am wishing for more detail in the dark areas.  Also, I think that you''ve included way too much emptiness in the left part of the frame.', '2006-01-30 12:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101908, 287416, 48890, '<td valign="top">Okay, if this subject needed to be off center, then you should give her space on the *right*, where she is looking, and not on the left.</td>', 'Okay, if this subject needed to be off center, then you should give her space on the *right*, where she is looking, and not on the left.', '2006-01-30 12:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101911, 287709, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good use of DOF.  Looks like you were not lucky with lighting; perhaps you should have used flash to bring more life to the gull.</td>', 'Nice composition and good use of DOF.  Looks like you were not lucky with lighting; perhaps you should have used flash to bring more life to the gull.', '2006-01-30 12:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101914, 288002, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors! Very nice clarity also...I like how the lid is "off-center" too!</td>', 'I really like the colors! Very nice clarity also...I like how the lid is "off-center" too!', '2006-01-30 12:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101916, 287905, 48890, '<td valign="top">Funny: I would normally comment tha that you needed to give the cop more space on the left, in the direction where she is looking, but in this shot your way actually works: it looks as though she is guarding the trash basket, creating a barrier for the eye as it enters the photograph on the left.  Not my favourite shot, but a nice one.</td>', 'Funny: I would normally comment tha that you needed to give the cop more space on the left, in the direction where she is looking, but in this shot your way actually works: it looks as though she is guarding the trash basket, creating a barrier for the eye as it enters the photograph on the left.  Not my favourite shot, but a nice one.', '2006-01-30 12:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101918, 288023, 48890, '<td valign="top">Not sure why this much space was needed on the right compositionally.  Also, it would be nice if the whole of the subject was in focus, but the front edge is not sharp.</td>', 'Not sure why this much space was needed on the right compositionally.  Also, it would be nice if the whole of the subject was in focus, but the front edge is not sharp.', '2006-01-30 12:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101919, 286116, 35804, '<td valign="top">Zesty indeed! I''m not usually a huge fan of this type of image, but this has zip and sas...and the light is great! You have managed to give a rather simple comp. amazing depth...well done.</td>', 'Zesty indeed! I''m not usually a huge fan of this type of image, but this has zip and sas...and the light is great! You have managed to give a rather simple comp. amazing depth...well done.', '2006-01-30 12:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101920, 288072, 35804, '<td valign="top">Very pretty light and colors...nicely done.</td>', 'Very pretty light and colors...nicely done.', '2006-01-30 12:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101921, 287358, 48890, '<td valign="top">The composition is messy; IMO, lower left corner is the worst place you could have chosen for the cone in this frame.</td>', 'The composition is messy; IMO, lower left corner is the worst place you could have chosen for the cone in this frame.', '2006-01-30 12:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101922, 287985, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice product shot... nothing else to tell you.</td>', 'Nice product shot... nothing else to tell you.', '2006-01-30 12:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101927, 286359, 48890, '<td valign="top">A nice capture, the picture has a good festive taste to it, lots of colours, a very nicely captured motion.  Compositionally it doesn''t work too well for me: if not for the title, I would not have guessed that the emphasis was on the star.</td>', 'A nice capture, the picture has a good festive taste to it, lots of colours, a very nicely captured motion.  Compositionally it doesn''t work too well for me: if not for the title, I would not have guessed that the emphasis was on the star.', '2006-01-30 12:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101929, 287629, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and the emptiness in one side of the frame is very well justified here, unlike in many other submissions.  The WOW factor is missing, though, for me.</td>', 'Nice shot, and the emptiness in one side of the frame is very well justified here, unlike in many other submissions.  The WOW factor is missing, though, for me.', '2006-01-30 12:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101930, 286481, 48890, '<td valign="top">Great composition and exposure.  Nice one!</td>', 'Great composition and exposure.  Nice one!', '2006-01-30 12:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101935, 287262, 48890, '<td valign="top">In close-up shots like these sharpness is very important: it''s lacking here.  Also, the white background can be good for stock photography, but to my taste, I am wishing for a more interesting background.  The idea with the ring on the flower seems quite tacky to me, but that''s probably just me.</td>', 'In close-up shots like these sharpness is very important: it''s lacking here.  Also, the white background can be good for stock photography, but to my taste, I am wishing for a more interesting background.  The idea with the ring on the flower seems quite tacky to me, but that''s probably just me.', '2006-01-30 12:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101937, 287521, 48890, '<td valign="top">Good capture, interesting post-processing.  Compositionally, I wish the butterfly was oriented differently: I don''t like it pointing in the direction of the lower left corner.</td>', 'Good capture, interesting post-processing.  Compositionally, I wish the butterfly was oriented differently: I don''t like it pointing in the direction of the lower left corner.', '2006-01-30 12:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2101944, 287515, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice, dynamic shot.  Putting the gallery off-center is justified by including the street sign into the frame.  Conversion to B&amp;W is also justified.  Not sure about the main in the end of the gallery.</td>', 'Nice, dynamic shot.  Putting the gallery off-center is justified by including the street sign into the frame.  Conversion to B&W is also justified.  Not sure about the main in the end of the gallery.', '2006-01-30 12:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
