(2103244, 287515, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice perspective shot ... remember this place the next time a perspective challenge comes up.  It''s weird that even though the main at the end of the arches is definitely placed off-centre, the illusion created by the shadows of the arches makes it look like he has climbed stairs and is approaching the centre of the photo ... but don''t worry, I''m not taking marks off because my eyes are being fooled.  Overall, very nice shot.  Good tonal range.  Lots of interest.</td>', 'This is a very nice perspective shot ... remember this place the next time a perspective challenge comes up.  It''s weird that even though the main at the end of the arches is definitely placed off-centre, the illusion created by the shadows of the arches makes it look like he has climbed stairs and is approaching the centre of the photo ... but don''t worry, I''m not taking marks off because my eyes are being fooled.  Overall, very nice shot.  Good tonal range.  Lots of interest.', '2006-01-30 18:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103248, 288012, 41522, '<td valign="top">Good work on this portrait.  Nice catchlight.  Interesting expression.  If you aren''t getting good votes, it might be bacuase people want more of an off-centre placement  perhaps by cropping along the backside of her head.  JMO.</td>', 'Good work on this portrait.  Nice catchlight.  Interesting expression.  If you aren''t getting good votes, it might be bacuase people want more of an off-centre placement  perhaps by cropping along the backside of her head.  JMO.', '2006-01-30 18:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103257, 287970, 41522, '<td valign="top">Good details on this macro.  The texture of the ash is very good.  Compositionaly, I would have preferred that the edge of the cigarette butt weren''t cropped out of the photo.  For me, the angle of the ash leads my eye up to the left side but because the subject has been cropped, it allows my eye to leave the photo off the edge.  JMO.</td>', 'Good details on this macro.  The texture of the ash is very good.  Compositionaly, I would have preferred that the edge of the cigarette butt weren''t cropped out of the photo.  For me, the angle of the ash leads my eye up to the left side but because the subject has been cropped, it allows my eye to leave the photo off the edge.  JMO.', '2006-01-30 18:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2103261, 286036, 41522, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot.  This is the fluffiest I have ever seen a flamingo.  For me, the eye of an animal or person is the central spot of the subject and where my eye rests.  For this challenge, I would have liked the eye to have been a little further from the centre.  Otherwise, a very fine photo.  JMO.</td>', 'A very nice shot.  This is the fluffiest I have ever seen a flamingo.  For me, the eye of an animal or person is the central spot of the subject and where my eye rests.  For this challenge, I would have liked the eye to have been a little further from the centre.  Otherwise, a very fine photo.  JMO.', '2006-01-30 18:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
