(2103274, 285075, 41522, '<td valign="top">Itmay be my bad eyes, but it looks to me that the focus point is somewhat behind the plane of the eyes, along the beard.  I would have liked a little sharper focus on the eyes.  Composition, for the off-centre is very good.</td>', 'Itmay be my bad eyes, but it looks to me that the focus point is somewhat behind the plane of the eyes, along the beard.  I would have liked a little sharper focus on the eyes.  Composition, for the off-centre is very good.', '2006-01-30 18:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
