(2103517, 287936, 41522, '<td valign="top">First, I'' not a fan of cats and I struggle with voting on phoos of them.  In order to get past that, the photo of the cat has to be very good.  This is maybe the first cat photo that made me want to stop and pause.  So why is that ... the eye is a wonderful colour and in nice sharp focus.  The colours of the cats fur are nice as are the details.  The black background ensure that the cat is the ocus of the photo.  So good work!!!</td>', 'First, I'' not a fan of cats and I struggle with voting on phoos of them.  In order to get past that, the photo of the cat has to be very good.  This is maybe the first cat photo that made me want to stop and pause.  So why is that ... the eye is a wonderful colour and in nice sharp focus.  The colours of the cats fur are nice as are the details.  The black background ensure that the cat is the ocus of the photo.  So good work!!!', '2006-01-30 20:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
