(2104163, 287095, 10867, '<td valign="top">This image would be considerably stronger, I think, if the bright, white area at the top left weren''t in the picture.  It pulls the eye away from the light that is your main subject.  Suggestion:  crop down to below that area.  You''ll then have a pano format image that will look quite interesting, IMO.</td>', 'This image would be considerably stronger, I think, if the bright, white area at the top left weren''t in the picture.  It pulls the eye away from the light that is your main subject.  Suggestion:  crop down to below that area.  You''ll then have a pano format image that will look quite interesting, IMO.', '2006-01-31 00:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104221, 287829, 43148, '<td valign="top">nicely done still life - even the border seems appropriate</td>', 'nicely done still life - even the border seems appropriate', '2006-01-31 01:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
