(2104657, 288064, 51228, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this image I failed to spot the cross... Once spotted I felt it could have been so much more and a contender. Shallower DOF, larger cross and a biot of cropping of the LHS would have got a 7 from me.</td>', 'When I first looked at this image I failed to spot the cross... Once spotted I felt it could have been so much more and a contender. Shallower DOF, larger cross and a biot of cropping of the LHS would have got a 7 from me.', '2006-01-31 08:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
