(2104773, 286586, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful titmouse.</td>', 'wonderful titmouse.', '2006-01-31 09:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104778, 287751, 48954, '<td valign="top">wow, very original framing. i love the idea. the colour could have been different, but good idea.</td>', 'wow, very original framing. i love the idea. the colour could have been different, but good idea.', '2006-01-31 09:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104787, 288014, 48890, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, but I am not sure that *that* much empty space is justified for the composition.</td>', 'An interesting idea, but I am not sure that *that* much empty space is justified for the composition.', '2006-01-31 10:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104789, 286562, 48890, '<td valign="top">A second entry with essentially the same idea behind the composition.  You have nice colours, I wish the composition was a bit more interesting.</td>', 'A second entry with essentially the same idea behind the composition.  You have nice colours, I wish the composition was a bit more interesting.', '2006-01-31 10:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104792, 287167, 48890, '<td valign="top">Sorry, the composition is not working for me.  My eyes are jumping all over the frame looking for a place to stop and are not finding it.</td>', 'Sorry, the composition is not working for me.  My eyes are jumping all over the frame looking for a place to stop and are not finding it.', '2006-01-31 10:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104801, 287846, 48890, '<td valign="top">The dog and the neck of the guitar are facing to the left, and yet you composed this with empty space on the right, for some reason; sorry, but the composition is not working here.  Also, the subject is hardly interesting for me.</td>', 'The dog and the neck of the guitar are facing to the left, and yet you composed this with empty space on the right, for some reason; sorry, but the composition is not working here.  Also, the subject is hardly interesting for me.', '2006-01-31 10:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104811, 287862, 48890, '<td valign="top">Judging by the title, the "cage" is essential for your composition, but the front bars are not in focus, and are hard to discern, since you included only parts of them.  I would have stopped the lens down and composed differently, perhaps including an empty span of bars to the left of the kid.</td>', 'Judging by the title, the "cage" is essential for your composition, but the front bars are not in focus, and are hard to discern, since you included only parts of them.  I would have stopped the lens down and composed differently, perhaps including an empty span of bars to the left of the kid.', '2006-01-31 10:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104812, 287417, 48890, '<td valign="top">A funny capture.</td>', 'A funny capture.', '2006-01-31 10:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104823, 285490, 48890, '<td valign="top">It''s funny how the leaning tree is compensated by a leaning man, good idea!  The light is not the best (I can see some good light in the top branches of the tree), and, IMO, the man and the trea would have been better in the right side of the frame, rather than the left: the way it is, the eye gets into the frame on the left, and immediately meets the main subject, so there is no reason for it to visit the left part of the frame.</td>', 'It''s funny how the leaning tree is compensated by a leaning man, good idea!  The light is not the best (I can see some good light in the top branches of the tree), and, IMO, the man and the trea would have been better in the right side of the frame, rather than the left: the way it is, the eye gets into the frame on the left, and immediately meets the main subject, so there is no reason for it to visit the left part of the frame.', '2006-01-31 10:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104829, 287567, 48890, '<td valign="top">The bush right in front of the tiger''s nose "stops" his sight, so there is no feeling that he is staring into space.  That is why I think that leaving that much space on the left in this composition is not justified: I would crop out everything past the growth in fron of the tiger.  Also, I wish the framing included at least his shoulders and front paws.</td>', 'The bush right in front of the tiger''s nose "stops" his sight, so there is no feeling that he is staring into space.  That is why I think that leaving that much space on the left in this composition is not justified: I would crop out everything past the growth in fron of the tiger.  Also, I wish the framing included at least his shoulders and front paws.', '2006-01-31 10:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104832, 287890, 48890, '<td valign="top">Not enough sharpness for the rocks, which are the only subject of the composition.  Also, I would flip the shot around the vertical axis, so that the big rock would be on the left side.</td>', 'Not enough sharpness for the rocks, which are the only subject of the composition.  Also, I would flip the shot around the vertical axis, so that the big rock would be on the left side.', '2006-01-31 10:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104836, 287811, 48890, '<td valign="top">The cracked paint and oxidation are pretty, but the rest of the things in the frame are not, and are distracting.</td>', 'The cracked paint and oxidation are pretty, but the rest of the things in the frame are not, and are distracting.', '2006-01-31 10:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104842, 286318, 48890, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the feeling of a dead end (it looks like there is a passage around the corner), but I really like this shot and the composition anyway!  I would not have done anything differently myslelf: a very nice night shot.</td>', 'I don''t get the feeling of a dead end (it looks like there is a passage around the corner), but I really like this shot and the composition anyway!  I would not have done anything differently myslelf: a very nice night shot.', '2006-01-31 10:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104846, 286762, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the boats, but for me there are too many horizontal lines.</td>', 'I like the boats, but for me there are too many horizontal lines.', '2006-01-31 10:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104851, 286440, 48890, '<td valign="top">A cute dog, but the shot has very little photographic merrit to it: focus is not right, the composition is not thought through, and the frame if full of distracting surroundings.</td>', 'A cute dog, but the shot has very little photographic merrit to it: focus is not right, the composition is not thought through, and the frame if full of distracting surroundings.', '2006-01-31 10:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104857, 287126, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting.  I know the bottom leaf is the subject, but I wish the whole flower had been included.  7</td>', 'I like the lighting.  I know the bottom leaf is the subject, but I wish the whole flower had been included.  7', '2006-01-31 10:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104861, 287651, 48890, '<td valign="top">A nice capture and a funny title.  The clasic black dog on a sunny day exposure conditiongs, but the dog is nicely exposed.  I don''t like the rendering of OOF elements in this shot: they are quie harsh; also, the bright spot on the ground is competing for my attention.  I think that you needed to do something with the background to subdue it a bit.</td>', 'A nice capture and a funny title.  The clasic black dog on a sunny day exposure conditiongs, but the dog is nicely exposed.  I don''t like the rendering of OOF elements in this shot: they are quie harsh; also, the bright spot on the ground is competing for my attention.  I think that you needed to do something with the background to subdue it a bit.', '2006-01-31 10:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104871, 287752, 48890, '<td valign="top">Isn''t the person fetching a ride in the *opposite* direction? :)  A nice shot, but I don''t like posture of the person in this shot: looks like he/she is simply looking at the sky lighting and does not add anything to the picture.</td>', 'Isn''t the person fetching a ride in the *opposite* direction? :)  A nice shot, but I don''t like posture of the person in this shot: looks like he/she is simply looking at the sky lighting and does not add anything to the picture.', '2006-01-31 10:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104874, 285966, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but it does not have an off-centered feeling.</td>', 'I like this shot, but it does not have an off-centered feeling.', '2006-01-31 10:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104880, 287150, 48890, '<td valign="top">Half the horse and half the house in a frame.  Courageous framing: +1 in my votes.  However, doesn''t quite work for me for some reason...  I think the wire fence, cutting the hource''s face into three parts is what is bothering me.</td>', 'Half the horse and half the house in a frame.  Courageous framing: +1 in my votes.  However, doesn''t quite work for me for some reason...  I think the wire fence, cutting the hource''s face into three parts is what is bothering me.', '2006-01-31 10:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104882, 286440, 43565, '<td valign="top">Cute dog, but this has the feel of a snapshot.  I think it would work better with a solid object (wall or couch) as the background.</td>', 'Cute dog, but this has the feel of a snapshot.  I think it would work better with a solid object (wall or couch) as the background.', '2006-01-31 10:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104884, 287440, 48890, '<td valign="top">The pelican definitely needs more spact in the frame in the direction where it is flying.</td>', 'The pelican definitely needs more spact in the frame in the direction where it is flying.', '2006-01-31 10:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104887, 286456, 43565, '<td valign="top">This does not have an off-centered feeling.  The composition does not hold my interest.</td>', 'This does not have an off-centered feeling.  The composition does not hold my interest.', '2006-01-31 10:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104891, 287987, 48890, '<td valign="top">A pleasing  sense of different intersecting directions in this shot: there are two directions, created by the fence lines, the horse bodies and the direction where the boy is looking.  What I don''t like is that there are some animals missing parts in this shot: I know it''s hard to coordinate things like that, but a shot is a shot, has to be perfect.</td>', 'A pleasing  sense of different intersecting directions in this shot: there are two directions, created by the fence lines, the horse bodies and the direction where the boy is looking.  What I don''t like is that there are some animals missing parts in this shot: I know it''s hard to coordinate things like that, but a shot is a shot, has to be perfect.', '2006-01-31 10:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104892, 287029, 43565, '<td valign="top">The focus is too soft for me, and I would like the background to be a solid color.  I do like the lighting and composition.</td>', 'The focus is too soft for me, and I would like the background to be a solid color.  I do like the lighting and composition.', '2006-01-31 10:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104894, 287313, 48890, '<td valign="top">A nice composition.  I don''t like the way the sheet is placed: it just doesn''t seem to make any sense. :)</td>', 'A nice composition.  I don''t like the way the sheet is placed: it just doesn''t seem to make any sense. :)', '2006-01-31 10:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104897, 286116, 48890, '<td valign="top">Aha, a nice composition!  I am not sure that I like the red colour in the background: orange already has a lot of red in it, so something more contrasty would work better for me.</td>', 'Aha, a nice composition!  I am not sure that I like the red colour in the background: orange already has a lot of red in it, so something more contrasty would work better for me.', '2006-01-31 10:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104898, 287640, 43565, '<td valign="top">The part of the flower most in focus is in the center of the shot.  I think the focus could be sharper, and additional lighting could be used to take away the shadows.</td>', 'The part of the flower most in focus is in the center of the shot.  I think the focus could be sharper, and additional lighting could be used to take away the shadows.', '2006-01-31 10:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104900, 287473, 43565, '<td valign="top">To me, for this challenge, the eyes should not be centered in the shot.</td>', 'To me, for this challenge, the eyes should not be centered in the shot.', '2006-01-31 10:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104901, 288026, 43565, '<td valign="top">The focus is too soft for me.</td>', 'The focus is too soft for me.', '2006-01-31 10:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104903, 287253, 48890, '<td valign="top">IMO the left shoulder is (unintentionally) almost missing from the body: needs more light.  A very nice composition, though, and difficult lighting.</td>', 'IMO the left shoulder is (unintentionally) almost missing from the body: needs more light.  A very nice composition, though, and difficult lighting.', '2006-01-31 10:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104906, 287853, 48890, '<td valign="top">The whole shot is leaning to the left, you needed to straighten it.</td>', 'The whole shot is leaning to the left, you needed to straighten it.', '2006-01-31 10:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104907, 287225, 48890, '<td valign="top">I don''t think off-centering this subject is justified.  In fact, its symmetrical placement asks for a central position in the frame.  Just my opinion...</td>', 'I don''t think off-centering this subject is justified.  In fact, its symmetrical placement asks for a central position in the frame.  Just my opinion...', '2006-01-31 10:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104908, 287767, 43565, '<td valign="top">The center flower draws my attention.  If you intended for the bottom flower to be the subject, I think you could have achieved this with different lighting.</td>', 'The center flower draws my attention.  If you intended for the bottom flower to be the subject, I think you could have achieved this with different lighting.', '2006-01-31 10:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104909, 286586, 48890, '<td valign="top">The compositoin would work better if the bird was looking the opposite direction.  A very nice isolation of subject, though.</td>', 'The compositoin would work better if the bird was looking the opposite direction.  A very nice isolation of subject, though.', '2006-01-31 10:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104915, 287185, 48890, '<td valign="top">IMO, the red thing in between the dog''s paws is in the wrong place, compositionally speaking.  Otherwise a nice framing.  The subject is cute, but hardly too interesting.</td>', 'IMO, the red thing in between the dog''s paws is in the wrong place, compositionally speaking.  Otherwise a nice framing.  The subject is cute, but hardly too interesting.', '2006-01-31 10:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104924, 288069, 48890, '<td valign="top">I like the idea with using coloured toothbrushes to form a picture; I like the detail of the exposure, but, sorry, the composition is just not working for me.  You should try shooting them some more, though, they are very tenderly coloured and the translucent handles and bristles are interesting to look at!</td>', 'I like the idea with using coloured toothbrushes to form a picture; I like the detail of the exposure, but, sorry, the composition is just not working for me.  You should try shooting them some more, though, they are very tenderly coloured and the translucent handles and bristles are interesting to look at!', '2006-01-31 10:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104930, 287755, 48890, '<td valign="top">Definitely oversharpened.  Compositionally, the branches on the left look like an overthought, rather than part of composition.  The tower is missing the detail of the stones, perhaps because of soft focus, or maybe because of bad conversion to b&amp;w.</td>', 'Definitely oversharpened.  Compositionally, the branches on the left look like an overthought, rather than part of composition.  The tower is missing the detail of the stones, perhaps because of soft focus, or maybe because of bad conversion to b&w.', '2006-01-31 10:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104937, 287920, 48890, '<td valign="top">I would place the bird int he TOP left corner; pacing it in the bottom corner creates an illusion that it flies low, which I don''t think was inteded by you (at least judging from the title).</td>', 'I would place the bird int he TOP left corner; pacing it in the bottom corner creates an illusion that it flies low, which I don''t think was inteded by you (at least judging from the title).', '2006-01-31 10:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104940, 286444, 48890, '<td valign="top">maybe bluriness of the pictrure was intended; either way, the shot isn''t working for me: I don''t like the composition with the tree on the left, and my eye hunts for detail in this landscape, anf finds none.  THe colour of the sky is overly saturated, while the colours of the ground and of the tree are dull</td>', 'maybe bluriness of the pictrure was intended; either way, the shot isn''t working for me: I don''t like the composition with the tree on the left, and my eye hunts for detail in this landscape, anf finds none.  THe colour of the sky is overly saturated, while the colours of the ground and of the tree are dull', '2006-01-31 11:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104947, 286351, 48890, '<td valign="top">Love this shot!  THe lines and shadows are unusual and a pleasure to look at, a very tight framing, great subject isolation!  Great job, a 10!</td>', 'Love this shot!  THe lines and shadows are unusual and a pleasure to look at, a very tight framing, great subject isolation!  Great job, a 10!', '2006-01-31 11:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2104950, 287025, 48890, '<td valign="top">Great find for this challenge, it DOES look like the duck (?) stepped back from the line.  I am wishing for better clarity, though, this looks like a crop at the expense of loosing detail.</td>', 'Great find for this challenge, it DOES look like the duck (?) stepped back from the line.  I am wishing for better clarity, though, this looks like a crop at the expense of loosing detail.', '2006-01-31 11:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
