(2104963, 287155, 48890, '<td valign="top">Man, I''m sorry, but this looks *disgusting* to me, and I don''t think you intended it that way (at least judging from the title). :)  The brownish red colour of the meat ball against the pale yellow of the cheese...  I appreciate your effort to set up and frame this shot, but I would be interested to know: what did you want to convey in it?  Since it''s unclear to me (and maybe I''m slow today), I am not giving this shot full marks.</td>', 'Man, I''m sorry, but this looks *disgusting* to me, and I don''t think you intended it that way (at least judging from the title). :)  The brownish red colour of the meat ball against the pale yellow of the cheese...  I appreciate your effort to set up and frame this shot, but I would be interested to know: what did you want to convey in it?  Since it''s unclear to me (and maybe I''m slow today), I am not giving this shot full marks.', '2006-01-31 11:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
