(2105229, 287823, 32966, '<td valign="top">Like the expression on his face.  I''m not sure I like seeing the little bit of woodwork on the wall, it''s a bit distracting.  Good work!</td>', 'Like the expression on his face.  I''m not sure I like seeing the little bit of woodwork on the wall, it''s a bit distracting.  Good work!', '2006-01-31 13:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
