(2105233, 285650, 32966, '<td valign="top">Could use a bit more focus and light on his face.  Great colour in the background, good composition.</td>', 'Could use a bit more focus and light on his face.  Great colour in the background, good composition.', '2006-01-31 13:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
