(2105317, 287952, 32966, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait, great expression.  I like the colour of the backdrop.</td>', 'Excellent portrait, great expression.  I like the colour of the backdrop.', '2006-01-31 13:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105323, 286318, 32966, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, great editing!  I really like the painted look and the soft muted colours.  Good work!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, great editing!  I really like the painted look and the soft muted colours.  Good work!', '2006-01-31 13:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105329, 287795, 32966, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a slightly tighter crop to get rid of the sidewalk and the shadow in the bottom middle.  Still a very nice shot.</td>', 'I''d like to see a slightly tighter crop to get rid of the sidewalk and the shadow in the bottom middle.  Still a very nice shot.', '2006-01-31 13:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105332, 287328, 32966, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and delicate.  Excellent DoF, good work!</td>', 'Very pretty and delicate.  Excellent DoF, good work!', '2006-01-31 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105474, 286849, 46586, '<td valign="top">Too bad for the out of focus -6</td>', 'Too bad for the out of focus -6', '2006-01-31 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105487, 286785, 43031, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of something that David Nightengale over at www.chromasia.com would take a picture of. If you live near this beach, a long look over the last year of his blog could give you some serious inspiration for beach (and other) photography. I like this well enough colors/contrast and comp wise, but I think some more sharpness  on the stump would really punch this up a bit more. Picky bit, your horizon it tilted to the right a little. Speaking of, I''m not sure that the horizon added to the photo really and you might have done better to take a top down angle gander at this. I''m seeing hints of patterns in that sand that are much more compelling to me than the flat and un-interesting (possibly distracting even) horizon/sky. Sorry, I just had a lot to say. Hope this helped.</td>', 'This reminds me of something that David Nightengale over at www.chromasia.com would take a picture of. If you live near this beach, a long look over the last year of his blog could give you some serious inspiration for beach (and other) photography. I like this well enough colors/contrast and comp wise, but I think some more sharpness  on the stump would really punch this up a bit more. Picky bit, your horizon it tilted to the right a little. Speaking of, I''m not sure that the horizon added to the photo really and you might have done better to take a top down angle gander at this. I''m seeing hints of patterns in that sand that are much more compelling to me than the flat and un-interesting (possibly distracting even) horizon/sky. Sorry, I just had a lot to say. Hope this helped.', '2006-01-31 14:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105490, 287448, 46586, '<td valign="top">Congratulations ;)</td>', 'Congratulations ;)', '2006-01-31 14:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105496, 286359, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wildly eccentric image, LOL. Nice how the star, which is LESS colorful, becomes the "subject" by virtue of its stillness. Very interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'Wildly eccentric image, LOL. Nice how the star, which is LESS colorful, becomes the "subject" by virtue of its stillness. Very interesting take on the challenge.', '2006-01-31 14:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105500, 287631, 46586, '<td valign="top">Way too small for a good appreciation</td>', 'Way too small for a good appreciation', '2006-01-31 14:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105539, 288002, 43031, '<td valign="top">This is a nice study in lighting, but I think the subjects lacks interest (for me) and it looks a little too staged. You don''t want to make it look like you tried hard, it has to be look efortless. (something I have yet to really achieve myself I''ll admit) If the light is to be obvious, then it should be an intrinsic part of the composition. The red spot distracts from the subject IMO, and looks like an afterthought. The right side of the jar (or whatever it is) needs a little more bounce or fill light also. Possibly having the white light on one side, and a diffuse soft red on the other maybe. Having the red on the other side negates the negative space leading you to the subject. Also I think makeing the silky BG into a specifc pattern that gently leads the viewer by the hand over to your subject would be nicer than the haphazard arrangement. Good elements here, but I think you need to practice the arrangment and setup some more.</td>', 'This is a nice study in lighting, but I think the subjects lacks interest (for me) and it looks a little too staged. You don''t want to make it look like you tried hard, it has to be look efortless. (something I have yet to really achieve myself I''ll admit) If the light is to be obvious, then it should be an intrinsic part of the composition. The red spot distracts from the subject IMO, and looks like an afterthought. The right side of the jar (or whatever it is) needs a little more bounce or fill light also. Possibly having the white light on one side, and a diffuse soft red on the other maybe. Having the red on the other side negates the negative space leading you to the subject. Also I think makeing the silky BG into a specifc pattern that gently leads the viewer by the hand over to your subject would be nicer than the haphazard arrangement. Good elements here, but I think you need to practice the arrangment and setup some more.', '2006-01-31 15:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105547, 286450, 46586, '<td valign="top">Way too small and difficult to read</td>', 'Way too small and difficult to read', '2006-01-31 15:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105577, 287769, 42005, '<td valign="top">So many things off center...I like it.  Great compostion, color and emotion.  Lovely.  9</td>', 'So many things off center...I like it.  Great compostion, color and emotion.  Lovely.  9', '2006-01-31 15:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105579, 286116, 42005, '<td valign="top">This is totally gorgeous.  I am mesmerized by the texture, shading, crispness and <br/>interesting topic. 10</td>', 'This is totally gorgeous.  I am mesmerized by the texture, shading, crispness and interesting topic. 10', '2006-01-31 15:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105589, 287030, 42005, '<td valign="top">Nicely done..crisp like the weather must be according to her stance.  Like everyone will say, the red hair is outstanding.  9</td>', 'Nicely done..crisp like the weather must be according to her stance.  Like everyone will say, the red hair is outstanding.  9', '2006-01-31 15:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105663, 287763, 42005, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled.  Just a wonderfully done shot in all arenas.  10</td>', 'Aptly titled.  Just a wonderfully done shot in all arenas.  10', '2006-01-31 15:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105844, 287923, 2223, '<td valign="top">Good book!</td>', 'Good book!', '2006-01-31 16:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105886, 286169, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the person.  It doesn''t work well as an off-centered subject, though.  I think that this particular style of photo works best in a full frame.</td>', 'Nice detail on the person.  It doesn''t work well as an off-centered subject, though.  I think that this particular style of photo works best in a full frame.', '2006-01-31 16:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105904, 287095, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I found the branches on this particular subject to be too distracting, though.  I know that just the light may have seemed to sparse, but it would have worked better if it was more defined.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I found the branches on this particular subject to be too distracting, though.  I know that just the light may have seemed to sparse, but it would have worked better if it was more defined.', '2006-01-31 16:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105912, 287078, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting on this one, and the solid black background really makes the subject stand out.</td>', 'Very nice lighting on this one, and the solid black background really makes the subject stand out.', '2006-01-31 16:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105924, 287527, 35602, '<td valign="top">excellent use of existing lines to create an even better off-centered subject.  The leading lines are also placed out of the center.  You did a wonderful job on this one.</td>', 'excellent use of existing lines to create an even better off-centered subject.  The leading lines are also placed out of the center.  You did a wonderful job on this one.', '2006-01-31 16:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105962, 287745, 35602, '<td valign="top">This was well composed, but you must have underexposed it a lot because there are artifacts all over the face of the cathedral (the many colors that are showing up as flecks of color.)  They actually clear up when you convert to black and white, which might have worked better on this one.</td>', 'This was well composed, but you must have underexposed it a lot because there are artifacts all over the face of the cathedral (the many colors that are showing up as flecks of color.)  They actually clear up when you convert to black and white, which might have worked better on this one.', '2006-01-31 16:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105968, 287525, 42984, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the saffron garment with the rest of the shot is great</td>', 'The contrast of the saffron garment with the rest of the shot is great', '2006-01-31 16:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105973, 288001, 42984, '<td valign="top">Pretty good focus with a moving target!</td>', 'Pretty good focus with a moving target!', '2006-01-31 16:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105979, 287565, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good capture, you might have wrung even more impact out of it with a tighter crop too</td>', 'Good capture, you might have wrung even more impact out of it with a tighter crop too', '2006-01-31 16:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105987, 287944, 42984, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty cool still life. I keep trying to decide if I should be looking at the plate r the cutlery</td>', 'That''s a pretty cool still life. I keep trying to decide if I should be looking at the plate r the cutlery', '2006-01-31 16:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105989, 287798, 42984, '<td valign="top">Sharpness may be an issue</td>', 'Sharpness may be an issue', '2006-01-31 16:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105992, 287862, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2006-01-31 16:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105995, 286044, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good study, nicely whimiscal</td>', 'Good study, nicely whimiscal', '2006-01-31 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2105999, 288070, 42984, '<td valign="top">Awesome macro and good challenge response</td>', 'Awesome macro and good challenge response', '2006-01-31 16:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106017, 287597, 42984, '<td valign="top">Very simple and minimalist, I like it</td>', 'Very simple and minimalist, I like it', '2006-01-31 16:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106019, 286355, 208, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the lighting and the overall look of this is flat. There doesn''t seem to be a lot of depth here; the one part of the shot out of focus is neatly cut off by the plate and so is shoved away, not really part of the picture.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the lighting and the overall look of this is flat. There doesn''t seem to be a lot of depth here; the one part of the shot out of focus is neatly cut off by the plate and so is shoved away, not really part of the picture.', '2006-01-31 16:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106026, 286907, 3032, '<td valign="top">It may be meant to be as contrasty as this, but I don''t like it.</td>', 'It may be meant to be as contrasty as this, but I don''t like it.', '2006-01-31 16:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106027, 286950, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good light and sharpness.</td>', 'Good light and sharpness.', '2006-01-31 16:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106030, 286043, 42984, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but the photo is extraordinary</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but the photo is extraordinary', '2006-01-31 16:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106054, 286354, 42984, '<td valign="top">This si a beautiful portrait. His hair is remarkable and is so beautifully featured by your lighting and setup. The whole effect seems to be a little spoiled by whatever is obscuring the top right of his head. If you had enough extra frame, that neutral top right area would have composed strongly if you shifted your subject over to the RH thirds line instead of the left.</td>', 'This si a beautiful portrait. His hair is remarkable and is so beautifully featured by your lighting and setup. The whole effect seems to be a little spoiled by whatever is obscuring the top right of his head. If you had enough extra frame, that neutral top right area would have composed strongly if you shifted your subject over to the RH thirds line instead of the left.', '2006-01-31 16:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106062, 286022, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great shot, well caught, he''s certainly upset and almost off-centred</td>', 'Great shot, well caught, he''s certainly upset and almost off-centred', '2006-01-31 16:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106071, 286351, 42984, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is terrific. Have no idea what it is and is somewhere between surreal and abstract. Well done</td>', 'Wow, this is terrific. Have no idea what it is and is somewhere between surreal and abstract. Well done', '2006-01-31 16:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106090, 287615, 42984, '<td valign="top">She is. I wish that this had come off for you, but I have the feeling that it hasn''t quite. No particular reason, perhaps it''s the minimal de-sat</td>', 'She is. I wish that this had come off for you, but I have the feeling that it hasn''t quite. No particular reason, perhaps it''s the minimal de-sat', '2006-01-31 17:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106101, 287645, 35602, '<td valign="top">Subject is a bit underexposed. A more shallow dof to block out much of the background, except the general shape of the arch, would have been a better framing technique.</td>', 'Subject is a bit underexposed. A more shallow dof to block out much of the background, except the general shape of the arch, would have been a better framing technique.', '2006-01-31 17:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106111, 286862, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of duck in action.  Your wings maintain a lot of detail, though they were most likely moving.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Nice capture of duck in action.  Your wings maintain a lot of detail, though they were most likely moving.  Very nicely done.', '2006-01-31 17:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106119, 286444, 42984, '<td valign="top">The old Lone Tree trick huh.  Love the colour work you''ve done PP</td>', 'The old Lone Tree trick huh.  Love the colour work you''ve done PP', '2006-01-31 17:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106141, 286909, 24913, '<td valign="top">Nice simplicity...... good colours</td>', 'Nice simplicity...... good colours', '2006-01-31 17:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106226, 287985, 47704, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem to meet the challenge.  It''s a good pic though.</td>', 'This doesn''t seem to meet the challenge.  It''s a good pic though.', '2006-01-31 17:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106237, 287873, 49652, '<td valign="top">So simple, so beautiful.  I love it.</td>', 'So simple, so beautiful.  I love it.', '2006-01-31 17:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106238, 288072, 47704, '<td valign="top">I like the pic but there seems to be a lot of noise in the blue area.</td>', 'I like the pic but there seems to be a lot of noise in the blue area.', '2006-01-31 17:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106245, 287970, 47704, '<td valign="top">Really interesting macro.  I''d be curious to know how you did this.  Did you light the cigarette and just let it burn?  That''s a lucky position if you did.</td>', 'Really interesting macro.  I''d be curious to know how you did this.  Did you light the cigarette and just let it burn?  That''s a lucky position if you did.', '2006-01-31 17:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106250, 287148, 47704, '<td valign="top">This would have been good if the pic was in focus.  I like the idea and the contrast but the child looks OOF.</td>', 'This would have been good if the pic was in focus.  I like the idea and the contrast but the child looks OOF.', '2006-01-31 17:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2106253, 286450, 47704, '<td valign="top">Should have cloned out the light switch.</td>', 'Should have cloned out the light switch.', '2006-01-31 17:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
