(2117081, 285901, 47294, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!!!  Typically I find sun in a shot, (particulary when back-lighting a subject) just ends up making for a bad photo.  Not in this case, great composition and great contrasting strong colours.  I love it. 10</td>', 'This is beautiful!!!  Typically I find sun in a shot, (particulary when back-lighting a subject) just ends up making for a bad photo.  Not in this case, great composition and great contrasting strong colours.  I love it. 10', '2006-02-03 03:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117087, 287773, 9906, '<td valign="top">I almost clicked on a six as soon as I saw this shot, but I had to stop and look at it some more.  This is one of those shots that makes you stop and look again.  And again.  And again.  The first thing I saw was the kittie.  Then the hands caressing the kittie.  Then I saw the whole scene.  The story behind the scene.  The emotion involved in the making of the shot.<br/> <br/>There are so many things ''wrong'' with this.  It''s soft focus where one would normally expect things to be sharp.  It''s very busy.  There is confusing motion blur.  It''s blown out in many areas.  But the emotional impact of the shot when you actually SEE the shot is incredible.  I''m glad I didn''t just click and move on like I''m afraid many will.  You have captured an incredible moment that will never be the same again.  I hope this does well here but am afraid that it won''t.  If it moves one other individual the way it moved me it won''t matter what it scores here.  You will have scored more than any cyber ribbon could ever be worth.<br/>Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'I almost clicked on a six as soon as I saw this shot, but I had to stop and look at it some more.  This is one of those shots that makes you stop and look again.  And again.  And again.  The first thing I saw was the kittie.  Then the hands caressing the kittie.  Then I saw the whole scene.  The story behind the scene.  The emotion involved in the making of the shot. There are so many things ''wrong'' with this.  It''s soft focus where one would normally expect things to be sharp.  It''s very busy.  There is confusing motion blur.  It''s blown out in many areas.  But the emotional impact of the shot when you actually SEE the shot is incredible.  I''m glad I didn''t just click and move on like I''m afraid many will.  You have captured an incredible moment that will never be the same again.  I hope this does well here but am afraid that it won''t.  If it moves one other individual the way it moved me it won''t matter what it scores here.  You will have scored more than any cyber ribbon could ever be worth.KudosTC', '2006-02-03 03:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117088, 287967, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is the third shot today that has made me stop and stare.  Do I like it?  I don''t know.  I will have to look at this for some time to come to that conclusion.  Does it move me?  Make me think?  Captivate me at some level that I don''t understand?  Yes.  For this I thank you.  That is the essence of what I want photography to be.  Not perfect but moving...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is the third shot today that has made me stop and stare.  Do I like it?  I don''t know.  I will have to look at this for some time to come to that conclusion.  Does it move me?  Make me think?  Captivate me at some level that I don''t understand?  Yes.  For this I thank you.  That is the essence of what I want photography to be.  Not perfect but moving...TC', '2006-02-03 03:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
