(2119901, 287907, 23855, '<td valign="top">Great comp, and beautiful use of makeup to accent the shadows of the eye. The foreshortening, lack of contrast in the midtones, and the bright highlight on the upper right side tend to flatten out the face, and make it look a little distorted. However, as a whole this image is absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'Great comp, and beautiful use of makeup to accent the shadows of the eye. The foreshortening, lack of contrast in the midtones, and the bright highlight on the upper right side tend to flatten out the face, and make it look a little distorted. However, as a whole this image is absolutely beautiful.', '2006-02-03 20:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119908, 287525, 23855, '<td valign="top">Great use of color here. I''m also loving the second statue in the back to add emphasis to the title. I think a little fill on the left side wouldn''t have hurt, but I also like the contrast. As a whole, great work.</td>', 'Great use of color here. I''m also loving the second statue in the back to add emphasis to the title. I think a little fill on the left side wouldn''t have hurt, but I also like the contrast. As a whole, great work.', '2006-02-03 20:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119916, 286177, 23855, '<td valign="top">Great use of a cast shadow here. It would have been interesting to see the shadow cast more vertically with a more rectangular crop. Although, the dichotomy in the porportion here is very interesting. Great work and good luck.<br/> <br/>-Matt.</td>', 'Great use of a cast shadow here. It would have been interesting to see the shadow cast more vertically with a more rectangular crop. Although, the dichotomy in the porportion here is very interesting. Great work and good luck. -Matt.', '2006-02-03 20:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119928, 286940, 23855, '<td valign="top">Great use of background and tone. Although I think a wee bit of fill from the bottom left would have really opened up the image and provided a lot more depth. The ear and jaw structures look a little off with the falloff. Otherwise, this is a great submission. Good luck, and good shooting.<br/> <br/>-Matt.</td>', 'Great use of background and tone. Although I think a wee bit of fill from the bottom left would have really opened up the image and provided a lot more depth. The ear and jaw structures look a little off with the falloff. Otherwise, this is a great submission. Good luck, and good shooting. -Matt.', '2006-02-03 20:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119934, 288054, 23855, '<td valign="top">I love it. I absolutely with out a doubt love it. A longer shutter speed and firing the flash at the second curtain would have made this one unreal. Great capture. <br/> <br/>-Matt.</td>', 'I love it. I absolutely with out a doubt love it. A longer shutter speed and firing the flash at the second curtain would have made this one unreal. Great capture.  -Matt.', '2006-02-03 20:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
