(2120260, 287936, 33672, '<td valign="top">Lighting is superb. Color and tones are great.</td>', 'Lighting is superb. Color and tones are great.', '2006-02-03 22:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120267, 286940, 33672, '<td valign="top">The lighting really adds emotion to this.</td>', 'The lighting really adds emotion to this.', '2006-02-03 22:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120268, 286284, 40718, '<td valign="top">If your camera is able, I would try a shallow DOF with a shot like this.  You can''t move the statue, but the background is pretty lame.  A shallow DOF, accomplished by using a big aperture like F/2.0 or something, will blur that background into something more pleasant.  Your composition is nice and I think works well.  When I see photography of other art (like statues), I''m looking for something to add to the statue rather than just record it.  This is most easily accomplished by dramatic lighting which gives us interesting shadows.  If this is outdoors, perhaps trying close to sunrise or sunset...</td>', 'If your camera is able, I would try a shallow DOF with a shot like this.  You can''t move the statue, but the background is pretty lame.  A shallow DOF, accomplished by using a big aperture like F/2.0 or something, will blur that background into something more pleasant.  Your composition is nice and I think works well.  When I see photography of other art (like statues), I''m looking for something to add to the statue rather than just record it.  This is most easily accomplished by dramatic lighting which gives us interesting shadows.  If this is outdoors, perhaps trying close to sunrise or sunset...', '2006-02-03 22:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120272, 286507, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great DOF</td>', 'Great DOF', '2006-02-03 22:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120275, 286022, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great capture that really needs to be sharper.</td>', 'Great capture that really needs to be sharper.', '2006-02-03 22:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120289, 287967, 33672, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this photo is great.</td>', 'The lighting on this photo is great.', '2006-02-03 22:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120306, 287185, 43031, '<td valign="top">VERY good pet pic, nice lighting. much better than the average snapshot that I see all the time.</td>', 'VERY good pet pic, nice lighting. much better than the average snapshot that I see all the time.', '2006-02-03 23:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120320, 286452, 43031, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, good sharpness and wonderful refraction in the handle. I think you could have smoothed out/blurred the jaggies at the left of the highlight on the handle though, that''s a bit distracting. good stuff overall.</td>', 'Lovely lighting, good sharpness and wonderful refraction in the handle. I think you could have smoothed out/blurred the jaggies at the left of the highlight on the handle though, that''s a bit distracting. good stuff overall.', '2006-02-03 23:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120322, 287483, 25787, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lighing.  I think pointing her belly away from the center not only fits the challenge, but adds a lot to the photo.</td>', 'Fabulous lighing.  I think pointing her belly away from the center not only fits the challenge, but adds a lot to the photo.', '2006-02-03 23:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120327, 286881, 43031, '<td valign="top">Eyes and face could have been a wee bit sharper, especailly the eyes. everything looks just a bit fuzzy here. (maybe no USM after resize??). I like the composition and the wooden fence background.</td>', 'Eyes and face could have been a wee bit sharper, especailly the eyes. everything looks just a bit fuzzy here. (maybe no USM after resize??). I like the composition and the wooden fence background.', '2006-02-03 23:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120343, 287907, 43031, '<td valign="top">wow, both eyes and the lips all in focus, I think that''s a first on the portraits i''ve seen so far in the challenge. I never really like desat pics though... or is she really that pale I wonder..... nice mole(serious). maybe a bit too much negative white on the left, but I love the contrast stripes, pale face, dark dark hair and shirt, and white BG... just noticed the face is totally desat on the right. don''t really like that you lose the ridgeline of the nose, lots of NI or NN(good?bad? i dunno).... still, 8 for those eyes. Would love to see this in color though.</td>', 'wow, both eyes and the lips all in focus, I think that''s a first on the portraits i''ve seen so far in the challenge. I never really like desat pics though... or is she really that pale I wonder..... nice mole(serious). maybe a bit too much negative white on the left, but I love the contrast stripes, pale face, dark dark hair and shirt, and white BG... just noticed the face is totally desat on the right. don''t really like that you lose the ridgeline of the nose, lots of NI or NN(good?bad? i dunno).... still, 8 for those eyes. Would love to see this in color though.', '2006-02-03 23:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120384, 287167, 33947, '<td valign="top">Excellent!!!  10</td>', 'Excellent!!!  10', '2006-02-03 23:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120433, 287661, 40370, '<td valign="top">It took me a second but I get it ... 120 ... I like the colors and wish the top left corner (the wall) wasn''t gray, but I see that you couldn''t crop it out for this off-center image.</td>', 'It took me a second but I get it ... 120 ... I like the colors and wish the top left corner (the wall) wasn''t gray, but I see that you couldn''t crop it out for this off-center image.', '2006-02-04 00:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120440, 287108, 40370, '<td valign="top">Love the fallen tree, it draws my eyes right which then emphasizes that your subject is off-center.</td>', 'Love the fallen tree, it draws my eyes right which then emphasizes that your subject is off-center.', '2006-02-04 00:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120458, 287095, 40370, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out the sky in the left corner, the subject is somewhat uninteresting, but to be honest I shoot pics like this all the time, however once I download them I realize there is no "pizazz" sort of speak. The branches do look cool and would probably be better suited for a different challenge.</td>', 'I would have cropped out the sky in the left corner, the subject is somewhat uninteresting, but to be honest I shoot pics like this all the time, however once I download them I realize there is no "pizazz" sort of speak. The branches do look cool and would probably be better suited for a different challenge.', '2006-02-04 00:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120465, 286862, 40370, '<td valign="top">Finally ... not just a "sitting duck" ... beautiful color and nice focus for a fleeting moment of activity, 8</td>', 'Finally ... not just a "sitting duck" ... beautiful color and nice focus for a fleeting moment of activity, 8', '2006-02-04 00:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120475, 286946, 40370, '<td valign="top">Absolutly awesome, what the #@*&amp; is that? Great color, great crop, great focus ... 10</td>', 'Absolutly awesome, what the #@*& is that? Great color, great crop, great focus ... 10', '2006-02-04 00:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
