(2120505, 287708, 40370, '<td valign="top">Where''s the bottom of the fence line, were there distracting elements to crop out? I think their whole bodies would have completed this otherwise beautiful image.</td>', 'Where''s the bottom of the fence line, were there distracting elements to crop out? I think their whole bodies would have completed this otherwise beautiful image.', '2006-02-04 00:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
