(2120532, 287538, 40370, '<td valign="top">Good idea, haven''t seen any mtn bikers in this challenge, would have liked a closer look at the subject and the red seems too bright with the other natural colors you''ve captured.</td>', 'Good idea, haven''t seen any mtn bikers in this challenge, would have liked a closer look at the subject and the red seems too bright with the other natural colors you''ve captured.', '2006-02-04 00:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
