(2121376, 286861, 40370, '<td valign="top">I scored this flower image higher than any other because you chose top/bottom centering which is refreshing in a challenge full of left/right images. Only change I''d like is a little more light in the center of the flower, 9.</td>', 'I scored this flower image higher than any other because you chose top/bottom centering which is refreshing in a challenge full of left/right images. Only change I''d like is a little more light in the center of the flower, 9.', '2006-02-04 12:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
