(2121420, 285849, 40370, '<td valign="top">Attractive color, not over processed, not sure why the large cactus looks a little fuzzy (may just be the needles).</td>', 'Attractive color, not over processed, not sure why the large cactus looks a little fuzzy (may just be the needles).', '2006-02-04 12:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121431, 287483, 40370, '<td valign="top">Her expression is priceless, the tones are a little harsh but I think that really works for this image, I like that model is on the left side (it seems most photographers gravitate to the right in a challenge like this), bumping up to 9.</td>', 'Her expression is priceless, the tones are a little harsh but I think that really works for this image, I like that model is on the left side (it seems most photographers gravitate to the right in a challenge like this), bumping up to 9.', '2006-02-04 12:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121442, 287925, 40370, '<td valign="top">Downright gorgeous lines, b&amp;w was a good choice for this symmetrical yet off-centered image, love it, bumping up 9.</td>', 'Downright gorgeous lines, b&w was a good choice for this symmetrical yet off-centered image, love it, bumping up 9.', '2006-02-04 13:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121461, 287358, 33947, '<td valign="top">Has sort of a metallic feel. Pretty neat! 6</td>', 'Has sort of a metallic feel. Pretty neat! 6', '2006-02-04 13:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121527, 285450, 31244, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Great tones and perfectly posed subjects. Shame its only a dolphin though. :D 9</td>', 'Very nice capture. Great tones and perfectly posed subjects. Shame its only a dolphin though. :D 9', '2006-02-04 13:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121611, 286783, 50674, '<td valign="top">:-) I am the type that really wants to know the title of the book. Apart from that, it''s like the photographer has snatched a moment out of the other person''s life, for me, that is what photographing is about, snatching moments, and for keeps of course. That is the feeling of it and for me, always the most important factor.<br/>The red in the background, both door/wall and red/orange in the flowers make for a good warm background. Cropping fine, at first I thought it could ''lose'' a bit on the right, but then again, this is ok.<br/>The light is the tricky bit. Contrast between the shadow and the light is strong. The tables and chairs being grey/silver does not help.</td>', ':-) I am the type that really wants to know the title of the book. Apart from that, it''s like the photographer has snatched a moment out of the other person''s life, for me, that is what photographing is about, snatching moments, and for keeps of course. That is the feeling of it and for me, always the most important factor.The red in the background, both door/wall and red/orange in the flowers make for a good warm background. Cropping fine, at first I thought it could ''lose'' a bit on the right, but then again, this is ok.The light is the tricky bit. Contrast between the shadow and the light is strong. The tables and chairs being grey/silver does not help.', '2006-02-04 14:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121702, 286861, 22689, '<td valign="top">The flower maybe needs more light to attract the attention of the viewer,anyway a nice idea.</td>', 'The flower maybe needs more light to attract the attention of the viewer,anyway a nice idea.', '2006-02-04 16:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121705, 287150, 22689, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo , with only 3 colors you have made a lovely composition.<br/>My vote : 9</td>', 'Very nice photo , with only 3 colors you have made a lovely composition.My vote : 9', '2006-02-04 16:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
