(2125525, 287448, 7628, '<td valign="top">I didn''t comment during the challenge, but this shot was a stunner - as it came up on the screen I gasped.  This is wonderful!  And to have the presence on mind to compose so well under the circumstances - well done indeed!  One of my favorites for the challenge and I''m suprised not to find it on the first page.  Congratulations on your new daughter - the real challenge begins!</td>', 'I didn''t comment during the challenge, but this shot was a stunner - as it came up on the screen I gasped.  This is wonderful!  And to have the presence on mind to compose so well under the circumstances - well done indeed!  One of my favorites for the challenge and I''m suprised not to find it on the first page.  Congratulations on your new daughter - the real challenge begins!', '2006-02-06 00:10:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2125536, 286507, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely gorgeous - I know how fast chickadees move, to get one this sharp, such good focus, good use of dof (lovely lovely background!) You have done a fabulous job!  Thought It would be in the top ten. Favorite for me!</td>', 'This is absolutely gorgeous - I know how fast chickadees move, to get one this sharp, such good focus, good use of dof (lovely lovely background!) You have done a fabulous job!  Thought It would be in the top ten. Favorite for me!', '2006-02-06 00:12:55.000000', NULL, 0),
