(2125653, 287951, 17507, '<td valign="top">hm, this got a much lower score than I thought it would (I gave this a 6). I think this image would have been helped by cropping a bit off the top (feels a bit too empty, even for this challenge) and sharpening the image a bit. a bit of dodge&amp;burn to bring out the highlights/shadows on the big fungus might have also helped give this some pop.</td>', 'hm, this got a much lower score than I thought it would (I gave this a 6). I think this image would have been helped by cropping a bit off the top (feels a bit too empty, even for this challenge) and sharpening the image a bit. a bit of dodge&burn to bring out the highlights/shadows on the big fungus might have also helped give this some pop.', '2006-02-06 00:36:10.000000', NULL, 0),
