(2125861, 286044, 37430, '<td valign="top"><i>Greetings from the Critique Club!</i> <br/> <br/><b>Technical:</b> <br/>Not much comment on this one. Pictures seems to be well exposed. <br/> <br/><b>Aesthetic:</b> <br/>Overall a great capture. I guess, cleaner window (without stains) would have give darker background and would have given "depth" to picture. The shine of light on window, due to whatever-is-on-glass is little distracting. And yes- the dog is cute :)<br/> <br/><b>Challenge:</b> <br/>For sure - it fits the challenge!<br/> <br/><b>Conclusion:</b> <br/>I feel is a good work done considering the harsh lighting and reflections. I dont know how the contrast could have been improved, but it could have given depth to photo. Maybe you could try with curves .. but I''m not to sure:)<br/> <br/>I''m by no means expert in area of photography. My comments are purely based on my limited understanding of technology and art behind digital photography. Apart from doing detailed evaluation of your submission, my intent is to learn different styles of photography by critically evaluating selective submissions. If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via email or PM.<br/> <br/>Wish you a great day!<br/><b><i>-Tej</i></b> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club!  Technical: Not much comment on this one. Pictures seems to be well exposed.  Aesthetic: Overall a great capture. I guess, cleaner window (without stains) would have give darker background and would have given "depth" to picture. The shine of light on window, due to whatever-is-on-glass is little distracting. And yes- the dog is cute :) Challenge: For sure - it fits the challenge! Conclusion: I feel is a good work done considering the harsh lighting and reflections. I dont know how the contrast could have been improved, but it could have given depth to photo. Maybe you could try with curves .. but I''m not to sure:) I''m by no means expert in area of photography. My comments are purely based on my limited understanding of technology and art behind digital photography. Apart from doing detailed evaluation of your submission, my intent is to learn different styles of photography by critically evaluating selective submissions. If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via email or PM. Wish you a great day!-Tej ', '2006-02-06 01:15:25.000000', NULL, 0),
