(2127202, 287515, 41746, '<td valign="top">Perfect! The perspective and tonal range is truly amazing. Lloyd Street will never be the same. Congrats!</td>', 'Perfect! The perspective and tonal range is truly amazing. Lloyd Street will never be the same. Congrats!', '2006-02-06 15:25:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2127209, 287618, 39850, '<td valign="top">Gave this a 7.  Thought it was a good shot - just if a little sharper/more definition (even on the verging silhouette) of the man at fore and the horizon was perfectly level (off by the slightest degree), make this even better in my opinion.</td>', 'Gave this a 7.  Thought it was a good shot - just if a little sharper/more definition (even on the verging silhouette) of the man at fore and the horizon was perfectly level (off by the slightest degree), make this even better in my opinion.', '2006-02-06 15:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2127217, 287950, 39850, '<td valign="top">Gave this a 7.  Thought it was a fairly good capture/candid and showed the ''moment'' well.  Not sure on the selective desaturation and toning, ''works'' but .. not sure.  Overall a little ''soft'' as well, whether that is pp or not, not sure - which again ''works'' but.. perhaps a bit sharper/more definition may have helped.</td>', 'Gave this a 7.  Thought it was a fairly good capture/candid and showed the ''moment'' well.  Not sure on the selective desaturation and toning, ''works'' but .. not sure.  Overall a little ''soft'' as well, whether that is pp or not, not sure - which again ''works'' but.. perhaps a bit sharper/more definition may have helped.', '2006-02-06 15:29:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2127224, 287631, 39850, '<td valign="top">Gave this a 4.  Liked the concept and thought it had potential.  Just needed to be bigger (640 width in this case) and, hard to discern, but possibly a nudge rotation up on the right.</td>', 'Gave this a 4.  Liked the concept and thought it had potential.  Just needed to be bigger (640 width in this case) and, hard to discern, but possibly a nudge rotation up on the right.', '2006-02-06 15:30:55.000000', NULL, 0),
