(2127511, 286862, 27735, '<td valign="top">Thanks Bear, this photo is actually very similar to my Birds entry, "Maestro", as well.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> jejee Had you pegged, eh? Congrats on 4th! </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-06 17:25:36.</i></td>', 'Thanks Bear, this photo is actually very similar to my Birds entry, "Maestro", as well. Originally posted by Bear_Music: jejee Had you pegged, eh? Congrats on 4th! ', '2006-02-06 17:23:54.000000', '2006-02-06 17:25:36.000000', 0),
