(2149600, 285628, 43437, '<td valign="top">I cant believe this didnt do better.  This is an incredible shot, a little old fashioned feeling with the windmill, and I am a sucker for nice windmills.  The only thing I can see is maybe they didnt like the trees in the way on the right side.</td>', 'I cant believe this didnt do better.  This is an incredible shot, a little old fashioned feeling with the windmill, and I am a sucker for nice windmills.  The only thing I can see is maybe they didnt like the trees in the way on the right side.', '2006-02-14 09:57:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2149940, 287617, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very captivating picture - the touch of red in the lower right corner is almost an afterthought as one views the picture, then it quietly steps up and adds just the right spark.</td>', 'A very captivating picture - the touch of red in the lower right corner is almost an afterthought as one views the picture, then it quietly steps up and adds just the right spark.', '2006-02-14 13:45:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151086, 286368, 46448, '<td valign="top">You know when that door opens up it takes ya to a whole nother place:)<br/>I wish you could have made the sky dark blue and the clouds less washed out, The top of the door could have been blended straighter: I like to use the rectangle tool on the edge of the door, get a 10-15 px area out from the door, then use the clone tool in the area. It gives it a nice straight line. Composition is great I wouldn''t change it. Good job on a nice surreal image!</td>', 'You know when that door opens up it takes ya to a whole nother place:)I wish you could have made the sky dark blue and the clouds less washed out, The top of the door could have been blended straighter: I like to use the rectangle tool on the edge of the door, get a 10-15 px area out from the door, then use the clone tool in the area. It gives it a nice straight line. Composition is great I wouldn''t change it. Good job on a nice surreal image!', '2006-02-14 22:46:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151779, 287907, 27164, '<td valign="top">Nice high-key effect.</td>', 'Nice high-key effect.', '2006-02-15 01:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2151821, 287936, 18450, '<td valign="top">Wonderful dof, colours and textures. I feel like I can reach out and stoke him.</td>', 'Wonderful dof, colours and textures. I feel like I can reach out and stoke him.', '2006-02-15 01:35:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2153756, 287865, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Really nice composition &amp; DOF.  Good choice of tones too.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Really nice composition & DOF.  Good choice of tones too.', '2006-02-15 13:11:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2153936, 287328, 48652, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by eostyles:</b></div><hr/><i> Great job.  I really like the background.  Was it taken with that DOF or was it done that way afterwards? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, well actually this was a little bit of both, I shot the picture with this depth of field, but then used a little gaussin blur on the edges of the background flowers, cause i felt they looked, guh, to say the least. Thanx though for the feedback, i''ll hopefully appear in another competition in the near future.</td>', 'Originally posted by eostyles: Great job.  I really like the background.  Was it taken with that DOF or was it done that way afterwards?   Thanks, well actually this was a little bit of both, I shot the picture with this depth of field, but then used a little gaussin blur on the edges of the background flowers, cause i felt they looked, guh, to say the least. Thanx though for the feedback, i''ll hopefully appear in another competition in the near future.', '2006-02-15 13:54:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2154815, 286725, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the angles but I''m not overly thrilled with the colors - which, I realize, are not within your control.  Maybe in duotone or B&amp;W?</td>', 'I like the angles but I''m not overly thrilled with the colors - which, I realize, are not within your control.  Maybe in duotone or B&W?', '2006-02-15 18:28:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2155682, 288071, 15711, '<td valign="top">I find it unreal how low this was in this challenge! I just loved this image and gave it a 10.  WOW</td>', 'I find it unreal how low this was in this challenge! I just loved this image and gave it a 10.  WOW', '2006-02-15 23:13:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2157210, 287126, 34365, '<td valign="top">ahh this reminds me of a young dancer.. very nice.</td>', 'ahh this reminds me of a young dancer.. very nice.', '2006-02-16 17:08:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2157381, 287844, 13077, '<td valign="top">This was underrated, IMO. I like the lighting a lot, and I like the composition to include the sun. But I guess the majority didn''t like it, so it got voted down (which is a shame)</td>', 'This was underrated, IMO. I like the lighting a lot, and I like the composition to include the sun. But I guess the majority didn''t like it, so it got voted down (which is a shame)', '2006-02-16 18:21:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2159545, 287805, 51269, '<td valign="top">i''d rather see a cat photo than a human, good job !</td>', 'i''d rather see a cat photo than a human, good job !', '2006-02-17 17:35:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2167172, 287313, 37893, '<td valign="top">The soft focus works well for me in this image! The sensuality just beams across my screen. Wonderful job Neil.</td>', 'The soft focus works well for me in this image! The sensuality just beams across my screen. Wonderful job Neil.', '2006-02-21 02:00:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2175796, 287805, 7322, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by patio127:</b></div><hr/><i> i''d rather see a cat photo than a human, good job ! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks...:D Apparently, that fellow dismisses any photo that includes a cat with a cut-and-paste comment for  Ridiculous! As if cats (and dogs and many other domestic animals) haven''t been a subject for artists since before recorded history! <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by patio127: i''d rather see a cat photo than a human, good job !   Thanks...:D Apparently, that fellow dismisses any photo that includes a cat with a cut-and-paste comment for  Ridiculous! As if cats (and dogs and many other domestic animals) haven''t been a subject for artists since before recorded history! ', '2006-02-23 12:08:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2178377, 287313, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is just a beautiful shot! I like everything about it. The lighting, the composition, the pose, and especially the negative space. A great model, and the flowing hair, and how she is looking up really help to make the shot. You have just put together everything perfectly to make a very, very strong image. Going into my favs :-)</td>', 'Wow, this is just a beautiful shot! I like everything about it. The lighting, the composition, the pose, and especially the negative space. A great model, and the flowing hair, and how she is looking up really help to make the shot. You have just put together everything perfectly to make a very, very strong image. Going into my favs :-)', '2006-02-24 02:44:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2181592, 286940, 14509, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.</td>', 'I love this shot.', '2006-02-25 08:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2187115, 286304, 45115, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised it didn''t place higher in the challenge...</td>', 'I''m surprised it didn''t place higher in the challenge...', '2006-02-27 13:01:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2196346, 287987, 49672, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  I would have liked more of the horses - even at the taken focal length you could have cropped some of the top without losing anything compositionally.  As it is, you only got 6 votes out of 191 below 4, so I would think that this was perceived pretty universally as being good, but not spectacular.</td>', 'I like this shot.  I would have liked more of the horses - even at the taken focal length you could have cropped some of the top without losing anything compositionally.  As it is, you only got 6 votes out of 191 below 4, so I would think that this was perceived pretty universally as being good, but not spectacular.', '2006-03-02 16:06:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2202571, 287650, 41051, '<td valign="top">Ok, I found out how to see the count. GrandpaPops</td>', 'Ok, I found out how to see the count. GrandpaPops', '2006-03-05 23:24:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2204358, 287078, 12750, '<td valign="top">background too dark</td>', 'background too dark', '2006-03-06 12:45:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2214433, 287185, 49652, '<td valign="top">Adorable pup and good pic!</td>', 'Adorable pup and good pic!', '2006-03-09 13:29:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2216243, 288067, 6349, '<td valign="top">On tenth look I have to wonder how I am the only person who has this in my favorites because it does indeed look more like art than a photo.</td>', 'On tenth look I have to wonder how I am the only person who has this in my favorites because it does indeed look more like art than a photo.', '2006-03-10 01:25:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2216412, 288067, 18450, '<td valign="top">Not the only one anymore JPR...don''t know how I missed this superb shot!</td>', 'Not the only one anymore JPR...don''t know how I missed this superb shot!', '2006-03-10 04:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2227368, 286444, 34659, '<td valign="top">What a great tree!  Terrific composition (as usual).  The blues in the sky are a tad too much for my personal taste and I would probably run the sky through Neat Image to reduce some of the noise (again I have a tendency to overdo that too).  Still I scored this an 8 during the challenge - congrats on the high score.  Great image.</td>', 'What a great tree!  Terrific composition (as usual).  The blues in the sky are a tad too much for my personal taste and I would probably run the sky through Neat Image to reduce some of the noise (again I have a tendency to overdo that too).  Still I scored this an 8 during the challenge - congrats on the high score.  Great image.', '2006-03-14 14:17:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2231818, 287955, 20530, '<td valign="top">Composition, exposure, detail...Flawless shot. Very nice.</td>', 'Composition, exposure, detail...Flawless shot. Very nice.', '2006-03-15 20:58:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2236402, 287155, 50641, '<td valign="top">on top of spaghetti, all covered with cheese, I lost my poor meatball... when somebody sneezed...  <br/> <br/>Competent shot - I gave it an 8 because originality delights me.  Meatballs can make me happy too ;-)  The only thing I''m not sure about are your image dimensions - they make the photo seem a little squat.</td>', 'on top of spaghetti, all covered with cheese, I lost my poor meatball... when somebody sneezed...   Competent shot - I gave it an 8 because originality delights me.  Meatballs can make me happy too ;-)  The only thing I''m not sure about are your image dimensions - they make the photo seem a little squat.', '2006-03-17 16:54:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2236671, 287651, 49652, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I don''t think he looks sad - he looks like he loves you. I like the placement of the pup in the frame.</td>', 'I really like this.  I don''t think he looks sad - he looks like he loves you. I like the placement of the pup in the frame.', '2006-03-17 20:29:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2237895, 287994, 27763, '<td valign="top">As others mentioned, this does look like a car ad, which of course is a complement because that just means that it looks very professional.  I agree with you that it''s not something I''d hang on my wall, but I''d be proud to have taken it just the same!</td>', 'As others mentioned, this does look like a car ad, which of course is a complement because that just means that it looks very professional.  I agree with you that it''s not something I''d hang on my wall, but I''d be proud to have taken it just the same!', '2006-03-18 18:15:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2239009, 286849, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...  Lovely dark tones.</td>', 'Beautiful...  Lovely dark tones.', '2006-03-19 13:17:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2242200, 287417, 35720, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your comments - much appreciated!</td>', 'Thanks everyone for your comments - much appreciated!', '2006-03-20 16:26:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2242892, 287967, 46045, '<td valign="top">i love the persepctive and composition. the lighting and her expression is really great too. and the choice of black and white really helps to emphasize her solemn expression. glad you caught a natural moment here. :) it makes for a great image.</td>', 'i love the persepctive and composition. the lighting and her expression is really great too. and the choice of black and white really helps to emphasize her solemn expression. glad you caught a natural moment here. :) it makes for a great image.', '2006-03-20 22:04:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2243701, 287967, 50441, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Great shot.</td>', 'Well done.  Great shot.', '2006-03-21 08:12:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2250282, 285969, 45003, '<td valign="top">Can''t explain why, but there''s something I like in this shot. Like your choice for the acid filter here.</td>', 'Can''t explain why, but there''s something I like in this shot. Like your choice for the acid filter here.', '2006-03-23 03:46:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2259781, 286359, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a nice composition. How can a technically superior image like this that obviously meets the challenge in such a unique way get only a 5.77? I will never cease to be amazed by DPC voters.</td>', 'Wow! What a nice composition. How can a technically superior image like this that obviously meets the challenge in such a unique way get only a 5.77? I will never cease to be amazed by DPC voters.', '2006-03-26 11:53:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2266313, 287651, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well, I for one LOVE pet photos and this is a stunning one!  He looks so noble. . .and the beautiful shining coat looks like velvet!<br/> <br/>Fantastic job!!!!!!</td>', 'Well, I for one LOVE pet photos and this is a stunning one!  He looks so noble. . .and the beautiful shining coat looks like velvet! Fantastic job!!!!!!', '2006-03-28 12:13:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2287906, 285901, 8367, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture and processing. Great job!</td>', 'Wonderful capture and processing. Great job!', '2006-04-05 00:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2292147, 285751, 25728, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The stringy wet hair ads interest, the green is a great contast color against the brown fur and the pink ears. Great choice there. I can see the struggle with the DOF here too - how to blur enough background while keeping all of the dogs expression. Good balance with that, though playing with the green saturation might have taken some of the focus off of the distractions on the background (it may be as good as it could be already though...) Great shot!</td>', 'I really like this. The stringy wet hair ads interest, the green is a great contast color against the brown fur and the pink ears. Great choice there. I can see the struggle with the DOF here too - how to blur enough background while keeping all of the dogs expression. Good balance with that, though playing with the green saturation might have taken some of the focus off of the distractions on the background (it may be as good as it could be already though...) Great shot!', '2006-04-06 14:13:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2303382, 285447, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is kinda nice, particularly because of the B&amp;W waterfall, but I can''t help but think that it might have been better if you had been a bit closer to the action and shot a bit wider angle to get your friend in more detail and add more depth to the shot. The hair seems a bit grainy and poorly defined... Seems like it was edited a bit? I don''t know.<br/> <br/>Fun shot though. I bet this would look fantastic with a tiny bit of burn work in the water (especially at the top) and printed large enough to let the girl be a bit larger that 640x480 allows...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-11 10:07:56.</i></td>', 'This is kinda nice, particularly because of the B&W waterfall, but I can''t help but think that it might have been better if you had been a bit closer to the action and shot a bit wider angle to get your friend in more detail and add more depth to the shot. The hair seems a bit grainy and poorly defined... Seems like it was edited a bit? I don''t know. Fun shot though. I bet this would look fantastic with a tiny bit of burn work in the water (especially at the top) and printed large enough to let the girl be a bit larger that 640x480 allows...', '2006-04-11 11:04:47.000000', '2006-04-11 11:07:56.000000', 0),
(2310751, 285901, 30807, '<td valign="top">This is seriously good - I suspect this entrant could make it in advertising photography. She has done two other shots which look to me like advertisements - the meal and the hiking boots, though I like the meal the best. <br/> <br/>The best of luck in your photography. And don''t worry about the going blind, unless your doctor knows something we dont - even if you sight is poor, as long as you can see to frame, the autofocus will usually take care of things. <br/> <br/>I have cataracts in both eyes, and thought my photographic days were over, but have had the left lens replaced, and now my sight in that eye, instead of being soft filter, is now better than 20/20 vision - as good as it ever was, even in childhood, and I am 58 now, but just getting into second stride with the digital camera. How marvellous it is to take a shot, and then not have to pay for film or printing, and to perfect it too!<br/> <br/>No other generation  has ever had what we have now - and what a joy to be able to share it!<br/> <br/>Best of luck in your goals - I am sure you will make it!</td>', 'This is seriously good - I suspect this entrant could make it in advertising photography. She has done two other shots which look to me like advertisements - the meal and the hiking boots, though I like the meal the best.  The best of luck in your photography. And don''t worry about the going blind, unless your doctor knows something we dont - even if you sight is poor, as long as you can see to frame, the autofocus will usually take care of things.  I have cataracts in both eyes, and thought my photographic days were over, but have had the left lens replaced, and now my sight in that eye, instead of being soft filter, is now better than 20/20 vision - as good as it ever was, even in childhood, and I am 58 now, but just getting into second stride with the digital camera. How marvellous it is to take a shot, and then not have to pay for film or printing, and to perfect it too! No other generation  has ever had what we have now - and what a joy to be able to share it! Best of luck in your goals - I am sure you will make it!', '2006-04-13 19:19:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326384, 285901, 35513, '<td valign="top">This shot leaped straight out of your lineup and into my heart!!  What an amazing capture!  The play of light is captivating and I love the sepia tones that you chose to work with.  If you haven''t considered making a print of this, you SHOULD!</td>', 'This shot leaped straight out of your lineup and into my heart!!  What an amazing capture!  The play of light is captivating and I love the sepia tones that you chose to work with.  If you haven''t considered making a print of this, you SHOULD!', '2006-04-19 16:18:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2328595, 287936, 31133, '<td valign="top">Missed this in the challenge - faving it now!</td>', 'Missed this in the challenge - faving it now!', '2006-04-20 05:42:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2333793, 285849, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image. Well done!</td>', 'This is a beautiful image. Well done!', '2006-04-21 21:10:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2355306, 287763, 52467, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgoeous photo..I love the way it fades out near the bottom of the skirt.</td>', 'This is a gorgoeous photo..I love the way it fades out near the bottom of the skirt.', '2006-04-29 02:59:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2426583, 285978, 13719, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, I love the expression and white background also</td>', 'very nice shot, I love the expression and white background also', '2006-05-17 17:35:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2440993, 284922, 36470, '<td valign="top">What an appropritate entry for that challenge this pic was!  LOL  My first thoughts were "fix the horizon."  Then looking a little closer, I see the power line pole.  Good choice to leave that in.  You should give the Dragan action a whirl on this.  You might get some cool results.  You are one brave man for stradling that fence..LOL</td>', 'What an appropritate entry for that challenge this pic was!  LOL  My first thoughts were "fix the horizon."  Then looking a little closer, I see the power line pole.  Good choice to leave that in.  You should give the Dragan action a whirl on this.  You might get some cool results.  You are one brave man for stradling that fence..LOL', '2006-05-20 18:27:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2442085, 285901, 16241, '<td valign="top">great photo!</td>', 'great photo!', '2006-05-21 01:58:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2443136, 286452, 29177, '<td valign="top">Love everything about this shot... fantastic color and light... would have to know what brand of beer before I could say that the subject was good ;-P</td>', 'Love everything about this shot... fantastic color and light... would have to know what brand of beer before I could say that the subject was good ;-P', '2006-05-21 15:07:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2481560, 286452, 58785, '<td valign="top">WHOA... Hot beer ;)<br/> <br/>Very nice photo :)</td>', 'WHOA... Hot beer ;) Very nice photo :)', '2006-06-03 16:06:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2510421, 287925, 51538, '<td valign="top">That is a great photo.  The location is very condusive to taking photos.  But it is very difficult to get all the tiny parts of the citiscape lined up so that they do not conflict.  The people and puddle make it even better.  Nice one, I have been down there several times and shot a fair few photos without half as much success....  A darned stupid title, BTW.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-12 19:08:55.</i></td>', 'That is a great photo.  The location is very condusive to taking photos.  But it is very difficult to get all the tiny parts of the citiscape lined up so that they do not conflict.  The people and puddle make it even better.  Nice one, I have been down there several times and shot a fair few photos without half as much success....  A darned stupid title, BTW.', '2006-06-12 20:08:33.000000', '2006-06-12 20:08:55.000000', 0),
(2510591, 287925, 57839, '<td valign="top">Exquisite.  Great tones, light, lines and a bonus reflection.  :)</td>', 'Exquisite.  Great tones, light, lines and a bonus reflection.  :)', '2006-06-12 21:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2529100, 285673, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very Kurt Cobain, if you don''t mind me saying. Love the high-key.</td>', 'Very Kurt Cobain, if you don''t mind me saying. Love the high-key.', '2006-06-19 15:52:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2603776, 287515, 36616, '<td valign="top">Brilliant capture. The tones are well kept, though I would like to see a version in less bright light. The shadows are excellent and the composition is wonderful. The street sign stops the boredom on the left hand side whilst the leading lines nudge you over to the left. Very well balanced.</td>', 'Brilliant capture. The tones are well kept, though I would like to see a version in less bright light. The shadows are excellent and the composition is wonderful. The street sign stops the boredom on the left hand side whilst the leading lines nudge you over to the left. Very well balanced.', '2006-07-09 18:48:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2614996, 287333, 39484, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this.  My uncle is a landscape painter and this looks like a subject he would choose.  Well done.</td>', 'I love the composition of this.  My uncle is a landscape painter and this looks like a subject he would choose.  Well done.', '2006-07-12 14:23:45.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2629039, 287538, 62199, '<td valign="top">Feel sorry for that chap you made ride up and down that track! ;)</td>', 'Feel sorry for that chap you made ride up and down that track! ;)', '2006-07-17 07:40:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2671407, 287313, 38127, '<td valign="top">Love the softness of this and the framing of your subject in the photo.. beautiful.</td>', 'Love the softness of this and the framing of your subject in the photo.. beautiful.', '2006-07-28 13:52:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2683816, 287943, 62671, '<td valign="top">I love the crackled surface the dish of ice cream is setting on.  The background is seriously busy.  If you pulled it forward and angled downward more to just have the ice cream on that crackled surface would have made a great shot.   You also have mulitple light sources casting 3 different shadows.  Something that I typically try to avoid.   I''m no pro, but some suggestions that might come in handy next time. <br/></td>', 'I love the crackled surface the dish of ice cream is setting on.  The background is seriously busy.  If you pulled it forward and angled downward more to just have the ice cream on that crackled surface would have made a great shot.   You also have mulitple light sources casting 3 different shadows.  Something that I typically try to avoid.   I''m no pro, but some suggestions that might come in handy next time. ', '2006-08-01 14:18:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2698639, 287924, 61394, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful, Sandy! i really like it a lot.</td>', 'This is just beautiful, Sandy! i really like it a lot.', '2006-08-06 02:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2737078, 288012, 47274, '<td valign="top">i really like this..alot</td>', 'i really like this..alot', '2006-08-17 15:46:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2775383, 287999, 43433, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous, colour combination is perfect!</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous, colour combination is perfect!', '2006-08-30 16:45:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2833795, 287067, 42135, '<td valign="top">My favorite bird and a perfect capture .. I gave you a 10 in this challenge!</td>', 'My favorite bird and a perfect capture .. I gave you a 10 in this challenge!', '2006-09-14 01:13:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2851490, 286354, 53316, '<td valign="top">I hate when people dress in period clothes and it seems like a costume.  It''s perfectly ironed or not the least bit dirty or... it just seems like dress-up and marrs the illusion.  What you did in this shot, and what I think you have a real knack for, is avoiding that.  <br/> <br/>It really looks like this is a wizard in his real, everyday robes, that you happened to find and photograph.  (The only thing would be that the ball he''s holding looks a little bit too plasticky and modern, but even that''s sort of minor here.)<br/> <br/>I like the composition.  I think it adds something that is head is not completely included.  Lighting is great and I love the expression on his face.</td>', 'I hate when people dress in period clothes and it seems like a costume.  It''s perfectly ironed or not the least bit dirty or... it just seems like dress-up and marrs the illusion.  What you did in this shot, and what I think you have a real knack for, is avoiding that.   It really looks like this is a wizard in his real, everyday robes, that you happened to find and photograph.  (The only thing would be that the ball he''s holding looks a little bit too plasticky and modern, but even that''s sort of minor here.) I like the composition.  I think it adds something that is head is not completely included.  Lighting is great and I love the expression on his face.', '2006-09-20 15:50:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2854648, 286354, 45651, '<td valign="top">Well done the color cast is what I think dropped your score. I would also suggest a better wizards ball perhaps a clear class ball.</td>', 'Well done the color cast is what I think dropped your score. I would also suggest a better wizards ball perhaps a clear class ball.', '2006-09-21 17:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2856848, 287705, 40106, '<td valign="top">wowwwww how cooool!!!!</td>', 'wowwwww how cooool!!!!', '2006-09-22 13:53:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2923202, 284890, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great job on those brown eyes.  Your color seems right on too.  A nice portrait.</td>', 'Great job on those brown eyes.  Your color seems right on too.  A nice portrait.', '2006-10-12 16:58:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2924314, 285901, 23484, '<td valign="top">June... This shot is fabulous.  I can''t believe the score you recived for this.  What''s even more amazing is that two people gave you a 1. Trolls Suck! I just added this to my favorites.  I love the almost monotone color which kind of gives it a barren desert look.  I had to check this out after you mentioned this is the same line of trees as horsebarn hill.</td>', 'June... This shot is fabulous.  I can''t believe the score you recived for this.  What''s even more amazing is that two people gave you a 1. Trolls Suck! I just added this to my favorites.  I love the almost monotone color which kind of gives it a barren desert look.  I had to check this out after you mentioned this is the same line of trees as horsebarn hill.', '2006-10-12 23:41:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3008211, 285209, 24111, '<td valign="top">Love the textures!</td>', 'Love the textures!', '2006-11-06 20:59:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3160729, 287313, 5885, '<td valign="top">I gave this a ten in voting Very classic shot.</td>', 'I gave this a ten in voting Very classic shot.', '2006-12-29 19:51:59.000000', NULL, 0),
